{
	chapter.04756ADCAD0B66D7.title: " &a&lForbidden Arcanus"
	chapter.05FA1E70C1243D83.title: " &a&lThe Undead Revamped "
	chapter.38A34E1F883BFD67.title: " &a&lCataclysm"
	chapter.5C99715F6042482A.title: " &a&lA.V.A"
	chapter.5E76F6232D62B202.title: " &a&lBorn in chaos"
	chapter.616A43D765D1EFD2.title: " &a&lMowzie´s mobs"
	chapter.6AEDA2F9BEB57759.title: " &a&lArs Nouveau"
	chapter.6B6638BB63A994C2.title: " &a&lDraconic Evolution"
	file.0000000000000001.title: " &r&lCrazyMC"
	quest.010BAD02A17734C1.quest_desc: ["&fBuried beneath the scorching sands of the &adesert &flies the ancient &aCursed Pyramid, &fa forgotten tomb consumed by curses, undead creatures and hidden treasures. To uncover its location, adventurers must craft the &aEye of the Desert, &fan artifact capable of guiding its bearer toward the ruins. While exploring the pyramid, carrying a &abrush &fis highly recommended, as many valuable relics and ritual objects remain hidden within suspicious sand scattered throughout the structure."]
	quest.010BAD02A17734C1.quest_subtitle: "&7Follow the Eye of the Desert"
	quest.010BAD02A17734C1.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eBeneath the Endless Dunes"
	quest.015D5AFC64751C49.quest_desc: [
		"&f&oWith the Axe of a Thousand Metals, perform:"
		"&f&oHorizontal Arc (right-click) and Vertical Shockwave (sneak + right-click)."
		"&f&oUnbreakable, but learn the timing."
	]
	quest.015D5AFC64751C49.quest_subtitle: "&7Sweep and shockwave"
	quest.015D5AFC64751C49.title: "&f&lAxe of a Thousand Metals: Techniques"
	quest.01FAA6B9770AC7BA.quest_desc: ["&fA grotesque &c&lzombie&r&f shambles through the world with a &6&lfishing rod&r&f in its hand and a &6&lbarrel&r&f on its back, containing its catch. It seems it has been looking for a new fishing spot. You must put an end to this &c&lundead fisherman&r&f and claim its catch."]
	quest.01FAA6B9770AC7BA.quest_subtitle: "&lAn undead fisherman seeking new fishing waters"
	quest.01FAA6B9770AC7BA.title: "&8&lZombie fisherman"
	quest.025542D2AA761BCA.quest_desc: ["&fAmong the most advanced transportation systems within &aDraconic Engineering &fstands the powerful &aDislocator Receptacle, &fa device capable of creating stable teleportation portals for players, creatures and even items. To construct a functional portal, adventurers must first build a frame of any size using &aDraconium Infused Obsidian &fwith a &aDislocator Receptacle &fintegrated into the structure. Once completed, simply right-click the receptacle using a bound &aDislocator &fand the portal will activate, instantly linking all passing entities to the stored destination coordinates."]
	quest.025542D2AA761BCA.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Dislocator Receptacle"
	quest.025542D2AA761BCA.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eGateways Across Dimensions"
	quest.0454DF25D2B8BCE2.quest_desc: [
		""
		"HP: &2&l30&f&r"
		"Spawns: &6&lAnywhere in the Overworld&f&r"
		"Attack: &2&l4&f&r"
		"Speed: &6&lREALLY FAST&f&r"
		""
		"Special Abilities:"
		"- Can &e&lspot enemies&f&r from &6&lvery far away&f&r, then rushes in with terrifying speed."
		"- Using an &d&lArapholia perfume bottle&f&r on a mob will cause The Moonflower to &c&ltarget that mob&f&r instead of you."
		"- &d&lArapholia flowers&f&r, which drop from this mob or spawn naturally, randomly put a &d&lscent&f&r on mobs, making The Moonflower &6&lhunt them down&f&r."
		"- The scent does &8&lnot affect undead&f&r unless it comes from the &d&lperfume bottle&f&r."
		"- Arapholia flowers can also be &2&lbrewed&f&r to give the &d&lsame effect&f&r."
		""
		"Weakness:"
		"- Has a chance to be &e&lstunned&f&r if hit while &6&lairborne&f&r."
		""
		"Note:"
		"- There is a rare chance of a &0&lblack petal block&f&r dropping. This block can be used to &d&linflict scent&f&r on mobs depending on the item placed in the middle slot:"
		"  - &b&lDiamond&f&r = &2&lPlayer&f&r"
		"  - &8&lRotten Flesh&f&r = &2&lUndeads&f&r"
		"  - &f&lBones&f&r = &2&lPets&f&r"
		"  - &c&lApple&f&r = &2&lAny living beings&f&r"
		"  - &f&lString&f&r = &2&lMonsters&f&r (except Moonflowers)"
		"  - &d&lArapholia&f&r = &2&lMoonflowers&f&r"
	]
	quest.0454DF25D2B8BCE2.quest_subtitle: "&lKill The Moonflower (Demonic undead)"
	quest.0454DF25D2B8BCE2.title: "&8&lKill The Moonflower"
	quest.051C19AEA346A5BA.quest_desc: ["&fWyvern equipment can be customized and greatly enhanced through the use of specialized &aModules. &fThese upgrades provide a wide variety of effects such as increased damage, mining speed, protection, movement abilities and many other improvements depending on the module installed. In addition, tools and armor can be equipped with an &aEnergy Module, &fallowing them to store energy internally so that all installed modules can function properly. Without sufficient stored energy, many advanced module abilities will remain inactive."]
	quest.051C19AEA346A5BA.quest_subtitle: "&7Enhance your equipment with modules"
	quest.051C19AEA346A5BA.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eModular Draconic Technology"
	quest.05FFDD0E20E133CA.quest_desc: ["&fA seasonal terror has arrived! &c&lSir Pumpkin Head&r&f, a mighty mini-boss, appears during the Halloween season on guard duty. Be prepared for a &c&lchallenging fight&r&f as he will attack you with a series of distinct phases, utilizing his &c&lhorse&r&f, &c&lexplosive pumpkins&r&f, and even his &c&ldetached head&r&f. Only the most skilled adventurers can defeat him."]
	quest.05FFDD0E20E133CA.quest_subtitle: "&lA mini-boss of seasonal terror"
	quest.05FFDD0E20E133CA.title: "&8&lSir Pumpkin Head"
	quest.08FA3BFDB80F2090.quest_desc: ["&fFrom the depths of ancient crypts and desolate wastelands, the &c&lBonescaller&r&f emerges. This monstrous skeleton is covered in bony scales, making it a terrifying and resilient foe. Its jagged claws are said to tear through armor as if it were paper. You must venture into the darkness and put an end to this skeletal horror."]
	quest.08FA3BFDB80F2090.quest_subtitle: "&lA skeletal terror risen from forgotten tombs"
	quest.08FA3BFDB80F2090.title: "&8&lThe Bonescaller"
	quest.0927221C089B601F.quest_desc: ["&fBeyond traditional relay systems lies the advanced &aWireless Energy Crystal, &fa draconic device capable of transmitting energy directly into compatible machines and components without requiring dedicated input or output crystals. This allows for cleaner and more flexible energy networks across your infrastructure. However, this convenience comes with a slight drawback, as wireless transmission operates somewhat slower compared to direct crystal connections."]
	quest.0927221C089B601F.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Wireless Energy Crystal"
	quest.0927221C089B601F.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eWireless Draconic Transmission"
	quest.09DBE1AA9A3F8A6C.quest_desc: ["&fA new threat has risen, a skeleton so powerful it is said to wield the very essence of destruction. The &c&lSkeleton Demoman&r&f, a creature of bone and fire, has been to plague the land. Its very presence brings an eerie silence to the world, as if it is waiting to strike its unsuspecting victims. It is up to you to face this foe and put an end to its reign of terror."]
	quest.09DBE1AA9A3F8A6C.quest_subtitle: "&lA terror that rises from forgotten tombs"
	quest.09DBE1AA9A3F8A6C.title: "&8&lThe Whispering Bones"
	quest.09F04E68AF8F4EF5.quest_desc: ["&fLurking within the cold darkness of the &aFrosted Prison &fare the terrifying &aAptrgangr, &fmassive cursed executioners capable of inflicting devastating damage upon unprepared adventurers. Their brutal attacks and overwhelming presence make them one of the deadliest enemies guarding the final path. Defeating at least &atwo &fof these monsters is highly recommended before challenging the ruler of the frozen prison."]
	quest.09F04E68AF8F4EF5.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat the Aptrgangr"
	quest.09F04E68AF8F4EF5.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eThe Butchers of the Frozen Depths"
	quest.0A19C4C36C2F9887.quest_desc: ["&fThe village alchemist is in desperate need of &c&lMonster Skin&r&f to create a new, powerful potion. These unique materials are only harvested from the various monstrosities that roam the darkest corners of the world. You must venture out and defeat these fearsome creatures to gather the required materials."]
	quest.0A19C4C36C2F9887.quest_subtitle: "&lGather the materials of chaos and horror"
	quest.0A19C4C36C2F9887.title: "&8&lThe Monstrous Hunt"
	quest.0B07238399715DE8.quest_desc: [
		"&f&oTrack a sleeping Frostmaw in snowy biomes."
		"&f&oSteal or obtain its Ice Crystal — either pick it from its hand or win it in battle."
	]
	quest.0B07238399715DE8.quest_subtitle: "&7The yeti of the frozen wastes"
	quest.0B07238399715DE8.title: "&f&lConquer the Frostmaw"
	quest.0BC826033C2E1FEB.quest_desc: ["&fUsing the power of the &aMechanical Fusion Anvil &fand a rare &aVoid Core, &fthe devastating &aWither Assault Shoulder Weapon &fcan be transformed into the far more dangerous &aVoid Assault Shoulder Weapon. &fThis enhanced version launches heavier void-infused rockets with increased gravity, making accurate shots more difficult to land. However, upon impact with the ground, the explosions unleash catastrophic &aarea damage &fcapable of destroying entire groups of enemies at once. Though immensely powerful, the weapon can also become a threat to its own wielder if used carelessly."]
	quest.0BC826033C2E1FEB.quest_subtitle: "&7Upgrade the Shoulder Weapon"
	quest.0BC826033C2E1FEB.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eVoidfire Artillery"
	quest.0BD340B467B7420F.quest_desc: ["&fThe halls of the &aFrosted Prison &fare patrolled by dangerous &aElite Draugr, &fcursed undead fighters far stronger than ordinary warriors. Their durability and combat abilities make them serious threats during exploration. Defeating at least &athree &fof these enemies will help reduce the overwhelming resistance protecting the prison's inner chambers."]
	quest.0BD340B467B7420F.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat the Elite Draugr"
	quest.0BD340B467B7420F.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eChampions of the Frozen Dead"
	quest.0C05A7D911E79D30.quest_desc: ["&fAmong the specialized chemical resources used within &aAlliance of Valiant Arms, &fthe valuable &aAcetone Solution &fstands out as one of the most important for weapon customization. This industrial chemical is required for applying colors, finishes and visual modifications to firearms through the &aA.V.A Colouring Table. &fWithout a stable supply of Acetone Solution, advanced weapon personalization and cosmetic modifications become impossible."]
	quest.0C05A7D911E79D30.quest_subtitle: "&7Produce Acetone Solution"
	quest.0C05A7D911E79D30.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eChemical Weapon Finishing"
	quest.0CD264A330EA4D82.quest_desc: [
		"&fThe air has grown cold, and the eerie glow of spectral pumpkins fills the night. A &c&lPumpkin Spirit&r&f, a restless soul bound to a withered &c&lJack-O'-Lantern&r&f, haunts the land. It glides through the darkness, its malicious laugh echoing through the trees as it seeks revenge on the living. You must confront this &c&lvengeful phantom&r&f and put its spirit to rest."
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/borninchaos/pumpkinspawn.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.0CD264A330EA4D82.quest_subtitle: "&lA spectral guardian of autumn darkness"
	quest.0CD264A330EA4D82.title: "&8&lA Pumpkin Spirit"
	quest.0D053DE72F12831E.quest_desc: ["&fA once-noble knight now wanders the world, its armor corrupted by a dark, chaotic energy. Its eyes glow with a malevolent light, and its movements are unpredictable and swift. You must face this &c&lfallen champion&r&f and put an end to its tormented existence."]
	quest.0D053DE72F12831E.quest_subtitle: "&lA noble warrior corrupted by dark forces"
	quest.0D053DE72F12831E.title: "&8&lFallen Chaos Knight"
	quest.0D2AD999EBAE1339.quest_desc: ["&fThe legendary blacksmith has tasked you with a truly monumental feat: to craft a full suit of armor from the formidable &c&lDark Metal&r&f. This requires not only a vast amount of material, but also the skill and courage to face the chaotic forces that protect it."]
	quest.0D2AD999EBAE1339.quest_subtitle: "&lForged in chaos, tempered by darkness"
	quest.0D2AD999EBAE1339.title: "&8&lChaos-Forged Armor"
	quest.0D54FFF22B58B991.quest_desc: ["&fAt the peak of all draconic technology lies the legendary &aChaotic Energy Core, &fthe ultimate fourth-tier energy component used for the most powerful fusion recipes available. Forged from overwhelming draconic and chaotic energy, this material is required for crafting endgame artifacts, legendary equipment and some of the strongest technological creations within &aDraconic Engineering. Only those who have fully mastered advanced fusion systems can hope to wield such power."]
	quest.0D54FFF22B58B991.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Chaotic Energy Core"
	quest.0D54FFF22B58B991.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eHeart of Chaotic Engineering"
	quest.0D8997562D85EC13.quest_desc: ["&fAt the heart of the &aFrosted Prison &fawaits the terrifying &aMaledictus, &fthe final and most dangerous boss of your journey. This cursed warrior possesses overwhelming strength, deadly speed and devastating abilities capable of annihilating even well-prepared adventurers in moments. Many of its attacks can instantly turn the battle against you if your reactions fail for even a second. Defeating Maledictus rewards valuable cursed materials used to forge legendary weapons such as the &aCursed Bow, The Annihilator &fand other powerful relics once wielded by the boss itself."]
	quest.0D8997562D85EC13.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat Maledictus"
	quest.0D8997562D85EC13.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eThe End of All Curses"
	quest.0DAE5BCCCA2F12FE.quest_desc: ["&fDeep within the scorching &aNether &flies the ancient &aSoul Black Smith, &fa forgotten forge consumed by fire and souls. To locate this dangerous structure, you must first craft the &aEye of Monsters, &fa mystical eye capable of guiding adventurers toward its hidden location. Beware, for inside rests a terrifying &anetherite monster &fwhose strength can easily overwhelm those who enter without powerful gear and preparation."]
	quest.0DAE5BCCCA2F12FE.quest_subtitle: "&7Follow the Eye of Monsters"
	quest.0DAE5BCCCA2F12FE.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eSoul Black Smith"
	quest.0ED90CC5E44D8ADA.quest_desc: ["&fBy compressing refined &aDraconium Ingots, &fit becomes possible to create the powerful &aDraconium Block, &fa dense storage form infused with concentrated draconic energy. Beyond simple storage, this block serves as an essential material for many advanced recipes and future fusion processes. As your mastery of draconic technology grows, these blocks will become increasingly important for crafting stronger components and legendary equipment."]
	quest.0ED90CC5E44D8ADA.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft a Draconium Block"
	quest.0ED90CC5E44D8ADA.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eCompressed Draconic Energy"
	quest.10C2F8C29D2D5EC1.quest_desc: ["The Agronomic Sourcelink is a machine that generates \"Source\" from crop and tree growth within a 15-block range. Magical plants, such as Mageblooms, Source Berry Bushes, and Archwood Saplings, provide bonus Source. The generated Source will be output from the Sourcelink to nearby jars within a 5-block range."]
	quest.10C2F8C29D2D5EC1.quest_subtitle: "Agronomic Sourcelink Generator."
	quest.10E179940477D829.quest_desc: [
		""
		"HP: &2&l25&f&r  "
		"Spawns: &6&lAnywhere in the Overworld&f&r  "
		"Attack: &2&l3&f&r  "
		"Speed: &6&lNormal&f&r  "
		""
		"Special Abilities:  "
		"- Exhales &d&lpink fumes&f&r that &8&lblock your vision&f&r and &8&lweaken your strength&f&r.  "
		"- Undead mobs that inhale the fumes gain &2&lpositive effects&f&r.  "
		"- Fumes can be &6&lblocked&f&r with a &7&lshield&f&r.  "
		""
		"Weaknesses:  "
		"- &4&lFire&f&r instantly kills them.  "
		"- They can be &6&ldecapitated&f&r by hitting them many times, which &c&ldisables&f&r their fume attacks.  "
		""
		"Lumber Variants:  "
		"- Deals &4&lmassive damage&f&r.  "
		"- Has &6&lincreased walk speed&f&r.  "
		"- Cannot be &6&ldecapitated&f&r."
	]
	quest.10E179940477D829.quest_subtitle: "&lKill The Wheezer (Illager Constructs)"
	quest.10E179940477D829.title: "&8&lKill The Wheezer"
	quest.11D7B306709F8DF4.quest_desc: ["Each glyph requires a set of items and experience points to unlock. Select a glyph by clicking on the menu and pressing select. Throw the items on the table as shown above, and the table will write that spell."]
	quest.11D7B306709F8DF4.quest_subtitle: "In this table you can see all the glyphs."
	quest.11D7B306709F8DF4.title: "Table for creating and placing glyphs"
	quest.136CA5950A22C66C.quest_desc: ["&fAt the absolute peak of &aDraconic Engineering &flies the legendary &aChaotic Fusion Crafting Injector, &fthe fourth and final tier of fusion technology. With this injector, adventurers gain access to the strongest equipment, artifacts and technological creations available within the mod. Crafting such a component requires sacrificing a &aDraconic Fusion Crafting Injector &fwithin an already advanced fusion setup, alongside incredibly valuable materials such as &aLarge Chaos Fragments &fand even a &aDragon Egg. &fOnly those who have conquered the powers of chaos itself can hope to forge this ultimate fusion device."]
	quest.136CA5950A22C66C.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Chaotic Fusion Injector"
	quest.136CA5950A22C66C.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eGateway to Chaotic Fusion"
	quest.14DF06C3C3609504.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Wyvern Axe"
	quest.14DF06C3C3609504.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eWrath of the Dragonforged"
	quest.14F4945338F8A24E.quest_desc: ["&fAs &aDraconic Engineering &fcontinues to expand into increasingly complex systems, recipes and fusion combinations can become difficult to remember. It is highly recommended to make use of &aJEI (Just Enough Items) &fto easily view crafting recipes, fusion requirements, module upgrades and progression paths for every draconic component and artifact. Mastering JEI will greatly simplify your journey through advanced draconic technology."]
	quest.14F4945338F8A24E.quest_subtitle: "&7Use JEI to discover recipes"
	quest.14F4945338F8A24E.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eKnowledge Through JEI"
	quest.1506BE7B585B6265.quest_desc: [
		""
		"HP: &2&l30&f&r  "
		"Attack: &2&l3&f&r  "
		""
		"Attributes: &6&lResistant&f&r to knockback and &6&lquite fast&f&r on its feet.  "
		""
		"Special Ability: Explodes and splatters &4&lgoo&f&r on the victim's face, leaving them &4&lvulnerable&f&r and afraid.  "
		""
		"Note: It usually jumps &e&l2 times&f&r before exploding. The timer &c&lresets&f&r if the target is not close enough. Hitting it right before it blows will make it &4&lburst instantly&f&r. Goo can be washed off with &9&lwater&f&r, and any mob covered in it will take extra &c&lfire damage&f&r."
	]
	quest.1506BE7B585B6265.quest_subtitle: "&lKill The Bomber (True Zombie)"
	quest.1506BE7B585B6265.title: "&8&lKill The Bomber"
	quest.15A0A593215FBF56.quest_desc: ["&fHidden deep underground and within dangerous dimensions lies the mysterious &aDraconium Ore, &fa mineral infused with powerful draconic energy. This resource serves as the foundation for nearly every machine, weapon, armor piece and advanced system throughout your draconic progression. Though seemingly ordinary at first glance, Draconium is the key material required to unlock technologies and powers far beyond mortal understanding."]
	quest.15A0A593215FBF56.quest_subtitle: "&7Obtain Draconium Ore"
	quest.15A0A593215FBF56.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eEchoes Beneath the Earth"
	quest.15C2813460334745.quest_desc: ["&fWhispers of a tormented soul echo from the forgotten corners of the world. This &c&lspirit, haunt&r&f by dark curses and living creature that approaches. Its sorrow and rage have made it a dangerous threat to those who wander near its domain. You must lay this &c&lrestless soul to rest&r&f by destroying its &c&lspectral form&r&f."]
	quest.15C2813460334745.quest_subtitle: "&lA soul unbound by death's embrace"
	quest.15C2813460334745.title: "&8&lA Restless Spirit"
	quest.16D13E23A676081F.quest_desc: ["&fSomewhere beneath the suspicious sands of the &aCursed Pyramid &flies the mysterious &aNecklace of the Desert, &fan ancient relic required to awaken the sleeping &aAncient Remnant. &fThis artifact cannot be obtained through combat alone, forcing adventurers to carefully search the buried remains and suspicious sand scattered throughout the structure. Bringing a &abrush &fwill greatly aid in uncovering the hidden treasure buried beneath the dunes."]
	quest.16D13E23A676081F.quest_subtitle: "&7Find the Necklace of the Desert"
	quest.16D13E23A676081F.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eRelic Hidden in the Sand"
	quest.1754D157344F024C.quest_desc: ["&fHandling explosives safely requires specialized tactical equipment. The &aC4 Controller &fis a portable device designed specifically for disabling planted &aC4 Charges &fbefore detonation. By aiming at an active explosive and holding right click, adventurers can begin the defusal process and safely deactivate the charge before its countdown expires. In dangerous combat situations, mastering bomb control can be just as important as knowing how to deploy explosives."]
	quest.1754D157344F024C.quest_subtitle: "&7Use the C4 Controller"
	quest.1754D157344F024C.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eRemote Bomb Defusal Systems"
	quest.178450F2B8618AB7.quest_desc: ["Cut down the tree and get wood to use in new crafts."]
	quest.178450F2B8618AB7.quest_subtitle: "You can find it in overworld."
	quest.178450F2B8618AB7.title: "The magic tree"
	quest.18C556E8139D18D8.quest_desc: ["Learn the basics of spellcasting with the Novice Spellbook. "]
	quest.18C556E8139D18D8.quest_subtitle: "Use the Novice Spellbook to cast a basic spell."
	quest.18C556E8139D18D8.title: "Cast Your First Spell"
	quest.1B38E9D9E99B5F02.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Chaotic Bow"
	quest.1B38E9D9E99B5F02.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eBow of Total Annihilation"
	quest.1C91EE2BBB874BBF.quest_desc: ["&fA faint, ethereal light dances in the deepest reaches of the world. It is said to be the form of a &c&lSpirit Guide&r&f, a being that helps lost souls find their way. Many have sought its wisdom, but few have ever found it. It is your task to locate this mysterious entity and learn what it has to teach."]
	quest.1C91EE2BBB874BBF.quest_subtitle: "&lA mystical being that guides the lost"
	quest.1C91EE2BBB874BBF.title: "&8&lThe Spirit Guide"
	quest.1D1396AFD4FCFB59.quest_desc: ["&fRecovered from the remains of &aThe Harbinger, &fthe legendary &aMechanical Fusion Anvil &fis one of the most important crafting stations for advanced progression. This ancient machine-forge allows adventurers to enhance powerful weapons and armor using rare materials such as &aVoid Cores &fand other legendary resources. Many of the strongest tools required for future boss fights can only reach their true potential through this mysterious anvil."]
	quest.1D1396AFD4FCFB59.quest_subtitle: "&7Obtain the Mechanical Fusion Anvil"
	quest.1D1396AFD4FCFB59.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eForge of Mechanical Ascension"
	quest.1D8EB0A0A29E4C76.quest_desc: ["&fAnother powerful protector resting within the &aCursed Pyramid &fis the fearsome &aKobolediator, &fa brutal undead warrior guarding the chambers surrounding the &aAncient Remnant. Defeating this sub-boss before the main encounter is strongly advised, as fighting them together can become overwhelming for unprepared adventurers. Upon defeat, the creature drops valuable crafting materials such as the &aKobolediator Skull &fand &aKoboleton Bones, &fboth required alongside the &aAncient Metal Ingot &fto forge powerful high-tier armor."]
	quest.1D8EB0A0A29E4C76.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat the Kobolediator"
	quest.1D8EB0A0A29E4C76.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eChampion of the Forgotten Arena"
	quest.1DC1876AEE66BBD3.quest_desc: [
		""
		"HP: &2&l50&f&r"
		"Spawns: &6&lY≥78 in the Overworld&f&r or in &6&lsnowy biomes&f&r"
		"Attack: &2&l10-13&f&r"
		""
		"Special Abilities:"
		"- Has &2&l2 main attacks&f&r, either to &4&lsmash&f&r or &4&limpale&f&r, and both are &6&leasy to dodge&f&r if you watch his movements."
		"- His attacks can also be &6&lparried&f&r, turning his strength against him."
	]
	quest.1DC1876AEE66BBD3.quest_subtitle: "&lKill The Bruin (Vikings)"
	quest.1DC1876AEE66BBD3.title: "&8&lKill The Bruin"
	quest.1FA43B9874D19737.quest_desc: ["&fA grotesque figure in tattered, colorful clothing lurches through the world, its horrifying smile frozen in place. This undead jester brings an &c&lunsettling aura&r&f wherever it goes, and its eerie laughter echoes through the night. You must &c&lsilence its twisted merriment&r&f for good."]
	quest.1FA43B9874D19737.quest_subtitle: "&lA twisted jester bringing nightmares to the world"
	quest.1FA43B9874D19737.title: "&8&lThe Cursed Clown"
	quest.2028E869D8866584.quest_desc: [
		""
		"HP: &2&l5-7&f&r"
		"Spawns: &6&lIn rivers when raining&f&r or when summoned by &6&lThe Possessive&f&r"
		"Melee: &2&l3&f&r + &2&l12% chance&f&r of inflicting &4&lRabies&f&r"
		"Speed: &6&l\"FAST\"&f&r"
		""
		"Special Abilities:"
		"- Can &6&llaunch itself&f&r when the target is out of reach, with &2&lno cooldown&f&r."
		"- Is fully &6&lmobile&f&r on both &9&lland&f&r and &9&lwater&f&r."
		"- Can inflict &4&lRabies&f&r, causing the target to suffer &c&lterrible consequences&f&r if they stay in &9&lwater&f&r while sick."
		""
		"Tip:"
		"- &e&lSunlight&f&r or &4&lfire&f&r are super effective against it."
		""
		"Note:"
		"- Mobs that are &2&lgooed&f&r will take extra &c&ldamage from fire&f&r, so use this to your &6&ladvantage&f&r."
	]
	quest.2028E869D8866584.quest_subtitle: "&lKill The Rabidus (Demonic Undead)"
	quest.2028E869D8866584.title: "&8&lKill The Rabidus"
	quest.20D52DFF02402D76.quest_desc: ["&fUsing refined &aDraconium Ingots, &fadventurers can craft the essential &aDraconium Core, &fone of the most important components throughout all of Draconic Engineering. This mysterious core is required for crafting equipment upgrade modules, fusion crafting systems, advanced tools and countless technological structures. In addition, it serves as a key ingredient in many future fusion recipes, making it a resource that will remain indispensable during your entire progression."]
	quest.20D52DFF02402D76.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft a Draconium Core"
	quest.20D52DFF02402D76.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eHeart of Draconic Engineering"
	quest.20FBA6FEFD649F3C.quest_desc: [
		"&f&oUse the Ice Crystal to unleash a sustained frost breath."
		"&f&oFreeze enemies by keeping the beam on target long enough."
	]
	quest.20FBA6FEFD649F3C.quest_subtitle: "&7Breathe winter like a Frostmaw"
	quest.20FBA6FEFD649F3C.title: "&f&lMaster the Ice Crystal"
	quest.2133A9B0C1E18F23.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Draconic Chestpiece"
	quest.2133A9B0C1E18F23.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eChestplate of Draconic Ascension"
	quest.2174B95D56F8B60A.quest_desc: ["&fHidden among the cursed treasures of &aMaledictus &flies the rare &aCursium Upgrade, &fa powerful smithing template capable of transforming ordinary &aNetherite Armor &finto the legendary &aCursium Armor. &fThis forbidden enhancement grants several powerful effects to its wearer, including the ability to &arevive after death &fwith a small amount of remaining health. Such power makes this upgrade one of the most valuable rewards obtainable from the final stages of progression."]
	quest.2174B95D56F8B60A.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Cursium Upgrade"
	quest.2174B95D56F8B60A.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eSecrets of Forbidden Resurrection"
	quest.229E869D17893FE6.quest_desc: ["&fRoaming the halls of the &aCursed Pyramid &fare packs of undead &aKoboletons, &fsmall skeletal creatures that may not appear especially dangerous alone. However, defeating at least &afive &fof these monsters is essential, as their remains provide valuable crafting materials used to forge powerful armor sets. These resources will become extremely useful when facing the far more dangerous bosses awaiting deeper within the pyramid."]
	quest.229E869D17893FE6.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat the Koboletons"
	quest.229E869D17893FE6.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eBones Beneath the Sand"
	quest.23A0DAC60FF5C4D0.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Wyvern Bow"
	quest.23A0DAC60FF5C4D0.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eBow of Draconic Precision"
	quest.23FA13D08B5AC5AD.quest_desc: ["&fAmong the strongest defenders of the &aFrosted Prison &fare the fearsome &aRoyal Draugr, &fancient cursed warriors capable of overwhelming careless adventurers with powerful attacks and relentless aggression. Defeating at least &athree &fof these elite undead soldiers is necessary to slowly secure the dangerous path leading deeper into the frozen fortress."]
	quest.23FA13D08B5AC5AD.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat the Royal Draugr"
	quest.23FA13D08B5AC5AD.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eKnights of the Frozen Curse"
	quest.2473E03FC857E774.quest_desc: ["Generates Source from nearby mob deaths and animal breeding. Additionally, it generates passive Source from baby animals and accelerates their growth."]
	quest.2473E03FC857E774.quest_subtitle: "Source from Animal Life."
	quest.2480A3EEE69E9027.quest_desc: [
		"&fModern firearms often rely on advanced optics to improve targeting efficiency and battlefield precision. Through the creation of specialized &aLenses, &fadventurers gain access to the crafting of various scoped weapons and firearms equipped with optical sights. These components become important materials for many advanced weapons focused on long-range accuracy and tactical combat performance."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/images/lens.png width:100 height:55 align:center}"
	]
	quest.2480A3EEE69E9027.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft Weapon Lenses"
	quest.2480A3EEE69E9027.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&ePrecision Combat Optics"
	quest.24D4C1542F268F97.quest_desc: ["&fAt the center of every advanced fusion system lies the powerful &aFusion Crafting Core, &fthe main structure responsible for controlling and executing the entire fusion process. This machine contains the primary interface used to manage fusion recipes, allowing adventurers to place the main item that will be transformed through draconic energy. From this interface, it is also possible to monitor the surrounding fusion materials and control the progression of increasingly complex crafting procedures."]
	quest.24D4C1542F268F97.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Fusion Crafting Core"
	quest.24D4C1542F268F97.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eCore of Fusion Engineering"
	quest.24D6C9B1DF37F28B.quest_desc: ["&fMining &aDraconium Ore &fdoes not directly yield usable metal, but instead produces unstable &aDraconium Dust, &fa raw material infused with draconic energy. By smelting this dust, adventurers can finally obtain refined &aDraconium Ingots, &fthe essential foundation for nearly every early-game machine, component and artifact within &aDraconic Engineering. Though simple compared to later creations, countless future technologies begin with this refined material."]
	quest.24D6C9B1DF37F28B.quest_subtitle: "&7Smelt Draconium Ingots"
	quest.24D6C9B1DF37F28B.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eRefined Draconic Power"
	quest.251717379192A981.quest_desc: [
		""
		""
		"HP: &2&l100&f&r  "
		"Spawns: &6&lAnywhere in the Overworld&f&r  "
		""
		"Melee Damage: &2&l7&f&r + &4&lKnockback&f&r  "
		"Puking Damage: &2&l4&f&r + &2&lPoison&f&r  "
		"Bodyslam Damage: &2&l15&f&r  "
		""
		"Special Abilities:  "
		"- Always spawns with &2&l4 zombies&f&r at her side.  "
		"- Can &6&lcontrol the minds&f&r of spiders, zombies, skeletons and more to fight against you.  "
		"- Spawns &2&l“Biddies”&f&r to chase targets from a distance.  "
		"- Upon death, she performs a &4&lbodyslam&f&r that deals &4&larea damage&f&r.  "
		"- Pukes to &6&lstun&f&r her target, often hitting her own minions.  "
		""
		"Weakness: Takes increased &c&lphysical damage&f&r when &4&lset on fire&f&r."
	]
	quest.251717379192A981.quest_subtitle: "&lKill The Pregnant (True Zombie)"
	quest.251717379192A981.title: "&8&lKill The Pregnant"
	quest.25D14E25D9A8A99A.quest_desc: ["&fAmong the first essential machines within &aDraconic Engineering &fstands the powerful &aGenerator, &fa device crafted using a &aDraconium Core &fand capable of producing the energy required to sustain your growing technological infrastructure. This machine becomes indispensable for powering advanced systems, fusion crafting devices, energy crystals and countless draconic artifacts. Without a stable source of energy, the true potential of draconic technology cannot be unleashed."]
	quest.25D14E25D9A8A99A.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Generator"
	quest.25D14E25D9A8A99A.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eBirth of Draconic Energy"
	quest.25E579FB18D667BC.quest_desc: ["The Volcanic Sourcelink generates Source by consuming burnable items like Archwood logs. It produces heat, spawns Lava Lilies, and converts stone into lava. Nearby Blazing Archwood will also burn in exchange for Source. The Sourcelink outputs to nearby jars."]
	quest.25E579FB18D667BC.quest_subtitle: "Source and Heat Generation System."
	quest.25F0E1F344B5D502.quest_desc: ["&fAt the final stage of draconic progression stands the legendary &aChaotic Staff of Power, &fthe ultimate fusion of destructive force, utility and chaotic energy. This artifact can be forged either by combining powerful chaotic-tier tools with a &aChaotic Core, &for by upgrading the previous &aDraconic Staff of Power &fthrough advanced fusion using materials such as the &aChaotic Core, Chaotic Energy Core &fand &aDraconic Core. &fThe result is one of the strongest and most versatile artifacts obtainable within all of &aDraconic Engineering."]
	quest.25F0E1F344B5D502.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Chaotic Staff of Power"
	quest.25F0E1F344B5D502.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eStaff of Infinite Dominion"
	quest.26047EE50FCD2373.quest_desc: ["&fAs draconic technology approaches its final stages, increasingly powerful energy systems become necessary. The &aDraconic Energy Core &fserves as a vital component for crafting advanced third-tier artifacts and several powerful fourth-tier creations through fusion crafting. In addition, this controller becomes a required material for the legendary &aChaotic Energy Core, &fthe ultimate energy component used within the highest level of draconic fusion technology."]
	quest.26047EE50FCD2373.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Draconic Energy Core"
	quest.26047EE50FCD2373.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eController of Advanced Draconic Energy"
	quest.2631074B7F2E134F.quest_desc: ["&fAt the peak of advanced draconic engineering lies the legendary &aDraconic Staff of Power, &fa fusion of multiple powerful tools into a single artifact of overwhelming capability. To forge this masterpiece, adventurers must combine the &aDraconic Sword, Draconic Pickaxe, Draconic Shovel &fand a &aDraconic Energy Core &fthrough advanced fusion crafting centered around a &aDraconic Core. &fThis legendary staff embodies both immense destructive force and unmatched utility, becoming one of the most iconic creations within all of &aDraconic Engineering."]
	quest.2631074B7F2E134F.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Draconic Staff of Power"
	quest.2631074B7F2E134F.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eThe Ultimate Tool of Power"
	quest.26577F9373D4B48D.quest_desc: [
		"&fAmong all the industrial resources used within &aAlliance of Valiant Arms, &fthe most essential is undoubtedly the powerful &aWork Hardened Iron. &fForged using a combination of &aIron &fand &aCopper, &fthis reinforced alloy serves as the backbone for nearly every weapon, workstation, ammunition type and tactical component found throughout the mod. Because of its constant use in military manufacturing, maintaining large quantities of this material will become absolutely necessary for long-term progression and equipment production."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/images/iron.png width:100 height:55 align:center}"
	]
	quest.26577F9373D4B48D.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft Work Hardened Iron"
	quest.26577F9373D4B48D.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eIndustrial Alloy Foundations"
	quest.272D846085C898B6.quest_desc: ["&fThe &aDraconic Fusion Crafting Injector &frepresents the third tier of fusion technology, allowing access to far more advanced recipes, powerful artifacts and high-end draconic equipment. Crafting this injector requires several extremely valuable components, including the &aDraconic Energy Core, Awakened Draconium Ingots &fand the advanced &aWyvern Core. &fWith this new tier of fusion, the true power of &aDraconic Engineering &fstarts to fully emerge."]
	quest.272D846085C898B6.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Draconic Fusion Injector"
	quest.272D846085C898B6.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eMastery of Advanced Fusion"
	quest.27A098F29EA23FDC.quest_desc: ["&fHidden within the flooded ruins of the &aSunken City &flie the remains and materials required to craft the mysterious &aAbyssal Sacrifice, &fthe ritual item needed to awaken the ancient horror sleeping below the abyss. To obtain its components, adventurers must defeat several dangerous &acreatures &fguarding the depths of the structure. The artifact itself can be crafted through &atwo different recipes, &fallowing you to choose the path that best suits your resources and preparation before facing what awaits beneath the ocean."]
	quest.27A098F29EA23FDC.quest_subtitle: "&7Prepare the forbidden offering"
	quest.27A098F29EA23FDC.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eRitual of the Abyss"
	quest.27FD3E9814B940AC.quest_desc: ["&fAn ancient &c&lknight&r&f, fused with a &e&lheavy door&r&f, stands vigilant before a forgotten chamber. Its &c&lrusted armor&r&f clanks with every step, a menacing warning to all who dare approach its post. You must &c&ldefeat this formidable foe&r&f to pass."]
	quest.27FD3E9814B940AC.quest_subtitle: "&lA guardian bound to its post by duty and decay"
	quest.27FD3E9814B940AC.title: "&8&lThe Iron Guardian"
	quest.28BD631828620D19.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Draconic Hoe"
	quest.28BD631828620D19.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eCultivator of Draconic Life"
	quest.2954B17F713A0C47.quest_desc: ["&fTo achieve ultimate power, you must craft a &c&lfull set of Nightmare Armor&r&f. This legendary equipment grants those brave enough to wear it extraordinary abilities and unparalleled strength. Collect all the necessary materials and forge this dark armor to prove your mastery over the mod's greatest challenges."]
	quest.2954B17F713A0C47.quest_subtitle: "&lBecome one with fear and darkness itself"
	quest.2954B17F713A0C47.title: "&8&lNightmare's Embrace"
	quest.2A00505117DAF97E.quest_desc: ["&fHidden within the depths of the &aSoul Black Smith &fawakens the terrifying &aNetherite Monstrosity, &fa colossal beast forged from ancient netherite and endless flames. During battle, the creature uses surrounding &alava &fto its advantage, turning the arena into a deadly inferno for unprepared adventurers. Enter this fight with strong gear and some form of &aheat or lava protection &fto survive its overwhelming attacks. Its drops are extremely valuable for future &acombats &fand progression, so make sure not to lose them."]
	quest.2A00505117DAF97E.quest_subtitle: "&7Survive the fury of molten lava"
	quest.2A00505117DAF97E.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eThe Heart of the Forge"
	quest.2A7DE7313AE9661A.quest_desc: [
		"&fNot every upgrade is focused purely on combat performance. The &aA.V.A Colouring Table &fallows adventurers to customize the appearance of their firearms with unique colors, finishes and visual styles. To apply weapon customization, players will require various crafting resources such as minerals, dyes and most importantly the valuable &aAcetone Solution, &falongside several additional materials depending on the desired design. Through this system, every weapon can gain its own distinct identity on the battlefield."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/images/colouringtable.png width:100 height:55 align:center}"
	]
	quest.2A7DE7313AE9661A.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the A.V.A Colouring Table"
	quest.2A7DE7313AE9661A.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eColors of the Battlefield"
	quest.2C31EA5F04956544.quest_desc: ["The Sourcestone is a magic block that stores mana and serves as a central component for many spells and spell crafting."]
	quest.2C31EA5F04956544.quest_subtitle: "You can find in some structures of the Ars."
	quest.2C31EA5F04956544.title: "Find the Sourcestone"
	quest.2E1F6AA5B4677249.quest_desc: ["&fAmong the most devastating weapons obtainable from the remains of &aMaledictus &frests the terrifying &aThe Annihilator, &fa colossal weapon built purely for destruction. Its overwhelming power allows skilled adventurers to crush enemies with catastrophic force, turning it into one of the strongest melee weapons available during the final stages of progression."]
	quest.2E1F6AA5B4677249.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft The Annihilator"
	quest.2E1F6AA5B4677249.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eHammer of Absolute Destruction"
	quest.2E35FB2A62D51EEC.quest_desc: [
		"&f&oWear an Umvuthana mask and trade 7 Gold Blocks with Umvuthi, the Sunbird."
		"&f&oActivate the blessing to cast Sun Strike or Sun Beam."
	]
	quest.2E35FB2A62D51EEC.quest_subtitle: "&7Trade with Umvuthi, the Sunbird"
	quest.2E35FB2A62D51EEC.title: "&f&lReceive the Sun’s Blessing"
	quest.2E9BDD2F6ADBA565.quest_desc: [
		"&fTrue mastery over modern weaponry begins at the &aA.V.A Mastery Workbench, &fa specialized station where adventurers can assign a permanent mastery path to their firearms. Once a mastery is selected, it cannot be changed, making every decision an important commitment. Each mastery provides unique combat objectives and progression challenges that, when completed, allow the weapon to gain levels and unlock powerful combat effects, enhancing its performance and granting additional advantages during battle."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/images/masterytable.png width:100 height:55 align:center}"
	]
	quest.2E9BDD2F6ADBA565.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the A.V.A Mastery Workbench"
	quest.2E9BDD2F6ADBA565.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&ePath of Weapon Mastery"
	quest.2EBDE8F52179F9BC.quest_desc: ["&fDeep within the blazing lands of the &aNether &flies the feared &aBurning Arena, &fa cursed battleground consumed by endless fire and ancient warriors. To uncover this dangerous place, adventurers must first craft the &aEye of Flame, &fan artifact capable of guiding its bearer toward the arena. Though few enemies roam this structure, each one possesses overwhelming strength capable of turning every encounter into a deadly battle surrounded by fire and destruction."]
	quest.2EBDE8F52179F9BC.quest_subtitle: "&7Follow the Eye of Flame"
	quest.2EBDE8F52179F9BC.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eArena of Eternal Flames"
	quest.2EDF4F1D7C44B272.quest_desc: ["The Worn Notebook is your guide to all things Ars Nouveau. "]
	quest.2EDF4F1D7C44B272.quest_subtitle: "Use a book and lapis lazuli to craft the Worn Notebook."
	quest.2EDF4F1D7C44B272.title: "&l&cCraft the Worn Notebook"
	quest.2EEC11C932E8D6C1.quest_desc: ["&fA terrible curse has befallen the local village, and the elders believe it is the work of a &c&lNightmare Stalker&r&f. This elusive and terrifying creature hunts the deepest, darkest caves, feeding on fear and causing an eternal night to fall upon the land."]
	quest.2EEC11C932E8D6C1.quest_subtitle: "&lA creature born from darkness and despair"
	quest.2EEC11C932E8D6C1.title: "&8&lShadows of the Deep"
	quest.311549BA2132E1E0.quest_desc: ["&fBeyond weapons, armor and fusion systems lies the branch known as &aDraconic Engineering, &ffocused on advanced mechanisms, teleportation technology, energy infrastructure and powerful utility devices. Within this stage, adventurers will gain access to highly sophisticated draconic creations capable of manipulating space, energy and transportation itself. One of the first major utility artifacts available is the &aDislocator, &fa draconic sphere capable of storing a fixed coordinate and instantly teleporting its user back to that location from almost anywhere simply by right-clicking while holding it. To save a destination, sneak and right-click with the artifact in hand. Once the coordinates are recorded, they become permanently bound to the Dislocator and cannot be changed. While incredibly useful for exploration and travel, the artifact possesses limited uses, making each teleport an important decision."]
	quest.311549BA2132E1E0.quest_subtitle: "&7Master advanced draconic technology"
	quest.311549BA2132E1E0.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eDraconic Engineering"
	quest.312CBE7A125E7E0E.quest_desc: [
		"&fModern warfare demands adaptability, and the &aA.V.A Modifying Table &fprovides exactly that. This specialized workstation allows adventurers to customize and upgrade firearms using a wide variety of tactical accessories and attachments. Through weapon modification, players can improve important statistics such as accuracy, recoil control, stability, fire rate and overall combat performance, allowing each weapon to be adapted for different combat situations and personal fighting styles."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/images/modifytable.png width:100 height:55 align:center}"
	]
	quest.312CBE7A125E7E0E.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the A.V.A Modifying Table"
	quest.312CBE7A125E7E0E.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eAdvanced Weapon Customization"
	quest.313CF888989232D4.quest_desc: ["&fA gruesome zombie shambles through the world with a &e&lbarrel&r&f strapped to its back. Its contents are unknown, but it's said to be a &e&lwalking treasure trove&r&f, just waiting for someone brave enough to &c&lsmash it open&r&f."]
	quest.313CF888989232D4.quest_subtitle: "&lA walking treasure trove waiting to be opened"
	quest.313CF888989232D4.title: "&8&lBarrel Zombie"
	quest.314F7DEACF949649.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Draconic Axe"
	quest.314F7DEACF949649.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eAxe of Catastrophic Force"
	quest.314FF06E51C01CB8.quest_desc: ["&fFar below the endless ocean sleeps the monstrous &aLeviathan, &fan ancient creature feared even by the horrors of the &aSunken City. &fTo awaken this beast, you must perform the ritual using the &aAbyssal Sacrifice, &fbeginning a deadly battle beneath the water itself. The Leviathan becomes nearly &ainvincible outside the ocean, &fmeaning the fight must take place underwater where its full power can be unleashed. Prepare carefully with ways to breathe and survive underwater, or risk drowning before the battle even ends. Defeating this terrifying boss rewards you with an extremely valuable &atool &fthat will prove useful in countless future encounters."]
	quest.314FF06E51C01CB8.quest_subtitle: "&7Face the ruler of the drowned depths"
	quest.314FF06E51C01CB8.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eTerror Beneath the Abyss"
	quest.320B80BBB79963B4.quest_desc: ["&fHidden deep within the burning lands of the &aNether &fstands the mysterious &aRuined Citadel, &fa dark fortress corrupted by void energy and forgotten power. To uncover its location, adventurers must craft the &aEye of the Void, &fan artifact capable of guiding its bearer toward the ancient structure. Though the citadel is not filled with endless enemies, the creatures dwelling within are far more &adangerous and valuable. &fPrepare carefully before entering, for the treasures and powers hidden inside will become essential for future progression."]
	quest.320B80BBB79963B4.quest_subtitle: "&7Follow the Eye of the Void"
	quest.320B80BBB79963B4.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eFortress of the Empty Flame"
	quest.3215A17FC2256104.quest_desc: ["&fBy combining the resilience of &aObsidian &fwith concentrated draconic energy, adventurers can obtain the powerful &aDraconium Infused Obsidian. &fThis reinforced material becomes essential for crafting advanced draconic devices, high-tier technological structures and several important artifacts required during the later stages of &aDraconic Engineering."]
	quest.3215A17FC2256104.quest_subtitle: "&7Obtain Draconium Infused Obsidian"
	quest.3215A17FC2256104.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eObsidian Infused With Dragonfire"
	quest.32675C9DDC85047E.quest_desc: ["&fA &c&lspiritual threat&r&f has appeared, a powerful &b&lmini-boss&r&f that spawns after the tenth day. Beware his magical projectiles, which summon &c&lEvocation Fangs&r&f, and his ability to summon undead allies. He can also stun you with a powerful blow, so be ready to dodge! Your goal is to &c&ldefeat this fanatic&r&f and stop his crusade."]
	quest.32675C9DDC85047E.quest_subtitle: "&lA powerful spiritual threat from beyond"
	quest.32675C9DDC85047E.title: "&8&lThe Missionary"
	quest.32916E1AE400AFA2.quest_desc: [
		"&f&oLocate a floating Lantern and defeat it."
		"&f&oCollect Luminous Jelly to gain temporary Night Vision."
	]
	quest.32916E1AE400AFA2.quest_subtitle: "&7Harvest luminous jelly"
	quest.32916E1AE400AFA2.title: "&f&lLantern Hunt"
	quest.32F4D1719C5EAD72.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Wyvern Pickaxe"
	quest.32F4D1719C5EAD72.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eFangs of the Deep Earth"
	quest.338C7716D39BE2EC.quest_desc: ["&fTo begin mastering advanced equipment customization, adventurers must first craft the essential &aModule Core, &fa component required for creating nearly every module within &aDraconic Engineering. &fModules are powerful upgrades that can be installed into draconic artifacts, tools and armor to provide a wide variety of abilities and enhancements. Some modules increase &aprotection, damage, speed, power, jump height &for even grant utilities such as &anight vision &fand automatic feeding among many others. Modules exist in several progression tiers, beginning with the standard early-game variants crafted using &aDraconium Ingots, Draconium Cores &fand &aModule Cores. &fBeyond these lie the more advanced &aWyvern, Draconic &fand finally &aChaos-tier &fmodules. In most cases, crafting higher-tier modules requires combining and upgrading modules from previous tiers."]
	quest.338C7716D39BE2EC.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Module Core"
	quest.338C7716D39BE2EC.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eFoundations of Modular Power"
	quest.33D2016466FA6F09.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Chaotic Chestpiece"
	quest.33D2016466FA6F09.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eArmor of the Chaosborn"
	quest.342F879E25BB59AD.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Spawns: &6&lY≥78 in the Overworld&f&r or in &6&lsnowy biomes&f&r"
		"Melee: &2&l7&f&r"
		""
		"Special Abilities:"
		"- Spawns with a &6&lpack of hunters&f&r that &2&lserve him&f&r and protect him."
		"- Without his hunters, he is basically a &7&lreskinned husk&f&r, so you can &6&lbully him&f&r without much mercy."
		"- Has a chance to drop the &d&lBrisk Attacker&f&r, a &6&llegendary weapon&f&r."
		"- He &4&lhates pillagers&f&r and will &6&lturn on them&f&r whenever he sees them."
		""
		"Brisk Attacker:"
		"- On &e&lright-click&f&r, it summons an &c&lextremely powerful orb&f&r that &6&lpushes anything&f&r out of its path."
		"- Downside: you will also be &c&lknocked back&f&r by the orb."
		""
		"Notes:"
		"- He can drop &2&ltons of ores&f&r or even a &d&lTotem of Undying&f&r."
		""
		"Tips:"
		"- Despite being almost &8&linvincible to physical damage&f&r, you can &6&lbypass his armor&f&r with &3&lelemental damage&f&r."
	]
	quest.342F879E25BB59AD.quest_subtitle: "&lKill The Royal (Vikings)"
	quest.342F879E25BB59AD.title: "&8&lKill The Royal"
	quest.3449545667B6492F.quest_desc: ["&fGuarding the strongest sections of the &aAcropolis &fare the powerful &aClawdians, &fheavily armored sea creatures capable of dealing devastating damage in close combat. Though only a few roam the structure, defeating at least &atwo &fof them is highly valuable, as their rare drops can later be used to craft unique &aweapons &fthat may greatly benefit certain combat styles and strategies."]
	quest.3449545667B6492F.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat the Clawdians"
	quest.3449545667B6492F.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eClaws of the Tempest"
	quest.34554509579CB0C3.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Chaotic Shovel"
	quest.34554509579CB0C3.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eChaos Excavator"
	quest.34D22214AAA28CB7.quest_desc: [
		"&fEvery explosive device requires a reliable ignition system, and the &aFuse &fserves exactly that purpose within &aAlliance of Valiant Arms. &fThis important component is used in the crafting of grenades, tactical explosives and various other destructive devices. Though small and simple in appearance, fuses are essential for controlling detonation systems and enabling safe explosive deployment during combat situations."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/images/fuse.png width:100 height:55 align:center}"
	]
	quest.34D22214AAA28CB7.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft Fuses"
	quest.34D22214AAA28CB7.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eIgnition Mechanisms"
	quest.36519ED7641B7719.quest_desc: ["&fAt the peak of military logistics stands the powerful &aAmmo Kit Supplier, &fa deployable ammunition station capable of automatically providing compatible magazines for nearby firearms. Once placed, adventurers can approach the supplier while holding a weapon to instantly receive the corresponding ammunition magazines. However, this device is designed as a permanent tactical deployment, as breaking the supplier will cause the entire station to disappear permanently."]
	quest.36519ED7641B7719.quest_subtitle: "&7Place the Ammo Kit Supplier"
	quest.36519ED7641B7719.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eAutomated Field Resupply"
	quest.36CE4B74EB26DA0B.quest_desc: ["&fUsing the remains gathered from the dangers hidden within the &aCursed Pyramid, &fadventurers can forge the powerful &aBone Reptile Armor, &fa durable set created from ancient bones and forgotten metals. Crafting this equipment requires valuable materials obtained from creatures such as the &aKoboletons, Kobolediator &fand other guardians of the tomb, including the rare &aAncient Metal Ingots. &fThis armor provides strong protection against future bosses and marks an important step toward surviving the increasingly dangerous encounters ahead."]
	quest.36CE4B74EB26DA0B.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Bone Reptile Armor"
	quest.36CE4B74EB26DA0B.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eArmor Forged from Ancient Bones"
	quest.373F39B5728EABF5.quest_desc: [
		"&f&oFace new bosses and creatures with unique AI and loot."
		"&f&oThis is just a checkmark to begin the questline."
	]
	quest.373F39B5728EABF5.quest_subtitle: "&7Checkmark to start the adventure"
	quest.373F39B5728EABF5.title: "&c&lWelcome to Mowzie’s Mobs"
	quest.37462DD4D6BE9E9B.quest_desc: [
		""
		"HP: &2&l15&f&r"
		"Spawns: &6&l78+ blocks above ground&f&r"
		"Attack: &2&l5&f&r"
		""
		"Special Abilities:"
		"They may look weak and squishy, but they can &c&lkill you really fast&f&r by &6&lrushing towards you&f&r, and you cannot &8&lknock them back&f&r once they have done it."
		""
		"There is a small chance of a &2&lBidy/Zombie baby&f&r riding them."
		""
		"Drops:"
		"&2&lMembranes&f&r that can be cooked to gain &2&lregeneration&f&r."
		""
		"Tips:"
		"If it is biting or latching onto you, try walking back to &6&llower ground&f&r because they cannot control their &6&lpitch&f&r when they are rushing."
		""
		"If you can hear their &e&lsound&f&r but cannot see them, try &6&llooking up&f&r."
	]
	quest.37462DD4D6BE9E9B.quest_subtitle: "&lKill The Sucker (Demonic undead)"
	quest.37462DD4D6BE9E9B.title: "&8&lKill The Sucker"
	quest.38BE797210F6A20D.quest_desc: ["&fFrom the remains of the defeated &aNetherite Monstrosity &fcomes the legendary &aInfernal Forge, &fa massive weapon infused with destructive power. When striking a solid block with &aright click, &fthe hammer unleashes a devastating &aarea attack &fcapable of crushing nearby enemies with explosive force. Beyond combat, the weapon also serves as a powerful &apickaxe, &fallowing its wielder to break through stone and ore with ease. Few tools embody both destruction and utility as perfectly as this infernal relic."]
	quest.38BE797210F6A20D.quest_subtitle: "&7Wield the power of the ancient forge"
	quest.38BE797210F6A20D.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eForged in Infernal Flames"
	quest.38FB256A5BCE58E8.quest_desc: ["&fAt the highest level of draconic fusion lies the legendary &aChaotic Core, &fa powerful component forged through the unstable energy of &aLarge Chaos Fragments, Draconic Cores &fand &aAwakened Draconium Ingots. &fThis material serves as one of the most important resources for advanced chaotic-tier crafting, unlocking access to some of the strongest artifacts and technological creations within all of &aDraconic Engineering."]
	quest.38FB256A5BCE58E8.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Chaotic Core"
	quest.38FB256A5BCE58E8.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eCore Forged From Absolute Chaos"
	quest.3915E159155F8F9E.quest_desc: ["&fA swift and relentless hunter, the &c&lScarlet Persecutor&r&f relentlessly stalks its prey from the shadows. Its crimson eyes burn with malice, and its every move is a testament to its singular purpose: to torment and destroy. You must face this &c&lmerciless entity&r&f to put an end to its &c&lreign of terror&r&f."]
	quest.3915E159155F8F9E.quest_subtitle: "&lA merciless hunter bound by malice eternal"
	quest.3915E159155F8F9E.title: "&8&lThe Scarlet Persecutor"
	quest.39CD51F00CC01388.quest_desc: ["&fA new terror has emerged from the depths of the Warped Forest and the End. The &c&lPhantom Creeper&r&f, a ghostly and ethereal variant of the classic mob, haunts the twisted fungi and vines as well as the void between the End islands, striking with &c&lsilent speed&r&f. Its &c&ltransmuted body&r&f makes it difficult to spot, and its &c&lexplosive power&r&f is even more devastating than its overworld counterpart. You must find and eliminate this spectral threat."]
	quest.39CD51F00CC01388.quest_subtitle: "&lA spectral terror from beyond dimensions"
	quest.39CD51F00CC01388.title: "&8&lA Phantom Creeper"
	quest.39EE5334A546BF3A.quest_desc: [
		"&fThis mod adds a lot of aggressive mobs, with their unique properties that can diversify and complicate your survival. Also adds new structures, equipment, blocks and achievements."
		""
		"{image:kubejs:block/borninchaosimage width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.39EE5334A546BF3A.quest_subtitle: "&lA mod full of chaos and dangerous creatures"
	quest.39EE5334A546BF3A.title: "&l&6Welcome to Born in Chaos"
	quest.3B268BEA794FAF4D.quest_desc: ["&fFor advanced demolition and tactical destruction, adventurers gain access to the powerful &aC4 Explosive Charge. &fThis device can be planted on nearly any surface by holding left click, after which an active countdown sequence will begin before detonation. Once the timer reaches zero, the explosive will detonate with devastating force, making it highly effective for breaching structures, clearing hostile zones and setting battlefield traps. However, active charges can still be safely neutralized using a compatible &aC4 Controller &fbefore detonation occurs."]
	quest.3B268BEA794FAF4D.quest_subtitle: "&7Deploy the C4 Explosive"
	quest.3B268BEA794FAF4D.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eControlled Demolition Charges"
	quest.3B59B352CA5AD92A.quest_desc: ["&fWithin the halls of the &aRuined Citadel &fstand two ancient &aEnder Golems, &fmassive guardians infused with unstable void energy. Defeating these powerful constructs rewards adventurers with rare &aVoid Cores, &fmysterious materials that will later be used to enhance some of the strongest weapons from the mod. However, such upgrades cannot be performed immediately, as a special &aanvil &fmust first be obtained before their true potential can be unleashed."]
	quest.3B59B352CA5AD92A.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat the Ender Golems"
	quest.3B59B352CA5AD92A.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eCores of the Forgotten Void"
	quest.3B7814A126F44463.quest_desc: ["&fAmong the greatest treasures hidden within the &aBurning Arena &flies the rare &aIgnitium Upgrade, &fa powerful smithing template capable of transforming ordinary &aNetherite Armor &finto the far stronger &aIgnitium Armor. &fThis upgrade is considered essential for surviving some of the most dangerous encounters still awaiting ahead, especially the final battles against the strongest bosses of the world."]
	quest.3B7814A126F44463.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Ignitium Upgrade"
	quest.3B7814A126F44463.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eSecrets of the Burning Forge"
	quest.3BE83E1EC9568033.quest_desc: [
		"&fTo perform a successful &aFusion Crafting &fprocess, all required materials must be placed directly onto the front face of the surrounding &aCrafting Injectors &fusing right click. Materials can also be removed at any time if mistakes are made during setup. The position or order of the ingredients does not matter, as long as every required component for the recipe is correctly placed within the fusion structure."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/images/ingredientes.png width:120 height:80 align:center}"
	]
	quest.3BE83E1EC9568033.quest_subtitle: "&7Understand the injector system"
	quest.3BE83E1EC9568033.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eRules of Fusion Placement"
	quest.3BEFFAAE5A155074.quest_desc: ["&fUsing the forbidden power of the &aCursium Upgrade &fand materials obtained from the frozen horrors of the &aFrosted Prison, &fadventurers can forge the legendary &aCursium Armor. &fThis powerful cursed set grants exceptional protection alongside unique abilities that greatly improve survivability during the deadliest encounters. Among its greatest powers lies the ability to cheat death itself, making the armor invaluable against catastrophic battles."]
	quest.3BEFFAAE5A155074.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Cursium Armor"
	quest.3BEFFAAE5A155074.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eArmor of the Eternal Curse"
	quest.3D62686038D6707B.quest_desc: ["&fHidden within the frozen lands of the snowy &abiomes &flies the terrifying &aFrosted Prison, &fan ancient cursed fortress consumed by ice, death and forgotten souls. To locate this final structure, adventurers must first craft the &aEye of Curse, &fan artifact capable of guiding its bearer toward the frozen ruins. The prison is heavily guarded by countless &aDraugr, &fturning every corridor into a brutal battle for survival as you approach the final horror waiting deep within the structure."]
	quest.3D62686038D6707B.quest_subtitle: "&7Follow the Eye of Curse"
	quest.3D62686038D6707B.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eThe Prison Beneath the Endless Winter"
	quest.3D855F9C60245E7C.quest_desc: ["&fAt the center of the unstable &aChaos Islands &fawaits the terrifying &aChaos Guardian, &fa dragon of catastrophic power far beyond the legendary Ender Dragon itself. Facing this creature without proper preparation is nearly suicidal, as its attacks can instantly destroy careless adventurers. The battle shares certain similarities with the Ender Dragon encounter, but the protective &aChaos Crystals &fcannot be destroyed through ordinary means. To break them, adventurers must either use a special &aChaos artifact &for lure the dragon into striking the crystals itself. Upon defeat, the Chaos Guardian rewards a valuable &aDragon Heart, &fwhile deep beneath the arena, where violent energy beams emerge from the ground, massive deposits of legendary &aChaos Shards &fcan be found."]
	quest.3D855F9C60245E7C.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat the Chaos Guardian"
	quest.3D855F9C60245E7C.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eThe Dragon Beyond Destruction"
	quest.3E4D2D643ABB8E16.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Draconic Pickaxe"
	quest.3E4D2D643ABB8E16.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eHarvester of Endless Depths"
	quest.3E664991DE02A516.quest_desc: ["&fA towering skeleton, its bones reinforced with dark iron, lumbers through the world with a menacing gait. It wields a massive, two-handed axe, its every swing a terrifying display of raw power. You must face this &c&lrelentless guardian of the undead&r&f and bring an end to its rampage."]
	quest.3E664991DE02A516.quest_subtitle: "&lA towering guardian of bone and iron"
	quest.3E664991DE02A516.title: "&8&lThe Skeleton Thrasher"
	quest.3F761784850950C0.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Chaotic Axe"
	quest.3F761784850950C0.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eAxe of Cataclysmic Destruction"
	quest.3FE077679A9A936F.quest_desc: ["&fBy channeling the immense power of a &aDragon Heart &fthrough advanced fusion crafting, ordinary &aDraconium Blocks &fcan be transformed into the legendary &aAwakened Draconium Block. &fThis material contains vastly superior draconic energy and represents one of the most important resources for advanced progression. From these blocks, adventurers can obtain &aAwakened Draconium Ingots, &fwhich serve as essential crafting materials for powerful second and third-tier technology, including the creation of the advanced &aDraconic Core."]
	quest.3FE077679A9A936F.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Awakened Draconium Block"
	quest.3FE077679A9A936F.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eAwakened Through Dragonfire"
	quest.3FF81E18D15F148A.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Enchanter's Wand."
	quest.3FF81E18D15F148A.title: "&f&lThe Enchanter's Wand"
	quest.40742F1DF886A605.quest_desc: ["&fWith the creation of the &aDraconic Energy Core, &fthe path toward the forbidden realm of &aChaos &fis finally unlocked. Beyond the distant End islands lie unstable chaos dimensions infused with overwhelming draconic energy and unimaginable destruction. From this point onward, only the strongest adventurers equipped with advanced draconic technology can hope to survive the horrors awaiting within the Chaos Islands."]
	quest.40742F1DF886A605.quest_subtitle: "&7Enter the final stage of draconic power"
	quest.40742F1DF886A605.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eThe Chaos Awakens"
	quest.409EA38BB8434B63.quest_desc: ["&fAt the center of the &aBurning Arena &fawaits the legendary &aIgnis, &fa devastating warrior empowered by unstoppable flames and overwhelming strength. Remaining still during this battle is a fatal mistake, as Ignis relentlessly pressures adventurers with brutal attacks capable of quickly ending the fight. Though some of its drops may not seem extraordinary at first glance, the rare &aIgnitium Ingots &fobtained from this boss are extremely valuable for crafting advanced equipment. Defeating Ignis multiple times may become necessary if you wish to gather enough materials for future legendary gear."]
	quest.409EA38BB8434B63.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat Ignis"
	quest.409EA38BB8434B63.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eThe Flame That Refuses to Die"
	quest.413135F6D3B6B6DC.quest_desc: ["&fDeep within the heart of the &aCursed Pyramid &fsleeps the terrifying &aAncient Remnant, &fan ancient ruler awakened through the power of the &aNecklace of the Desert. &fFrom this point onward, the challenges ahead become far more dangerous, as bosses begin using increasingly complex &amechanics &fthat can drastically change the flow of battle. Careless adventurers may quickly find themselves overwhelmed by the creature's devastating attacks. Those capable of defeating the Ancient Remnant may earn a rare reward: a unique &apet &fthat can later be domesticated using bones gathered from creatures within the dungeon."]
	quest.413135F6D3B6B6DC.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat the Ancient Remnant"
	quest.413135F6D3B6B6DC.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eThe King Beneath the Dunes"
	quest.42409AB6DFD5573B.quest_desc: ["&fWithin the cursed chambers beside the resting place of the &aAncient Remnant &fsleeps the dangerous &aWadjet, &fa powerful guardian capable of turning an already deadly battle into complete chaos if left alive. It is highly recommended to defeat this sub-boss before awakening the true ruler of the pyramid. Its drops are also extremely valuable for crafting stronger armor, especially materials such as the &aAncient Metal Ingot &fneeded for advanced equipment."]
	quest.42409AB6DFD5573B.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat Wadjet"
	quest.42409AB6DFD5573B.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eGuardian of the Sleeping Tomb"
	quest.42B39EA1DCB20B63.quest_desc: ["&fScattered throughout the halls of the &aAncient Factory &fare dangerous surveillance constructs known as &aThe Watchers. &fWhile not among the strongest enemies within the structure, their constant attacks and ability to overwhelm careless adventurers make them a persistent threat during exploration. Defeating at least &afive &fof these mechanical creatures will help secure the surrounding area before confronting the horrors waiting deeper within the factory."]
	quest.42B39EA1DCB20B63.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat The Watchers"
	quest.42B39EA1DCB20B63.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eEyes Within the Machinery"
	quest.433F4124E447AC67.quest_desc: ["&fForged using the immense energy contained within &aAwakened Draconium, &fthe legendary &aDraconic Core &frepresents one of the highest tiers of draconic components obtainable before true endgame technology. This powerful core is required for crafting advanced high-value modules, powerful equipment upgrades and the construction of third and fourth-tier fusion crafting systems. As progression reaches its final stages, the Draconic Core becomes an indispensable material for nearly every endgame creation within &aDraconic Engineering."]
	quest.433F4124E447AC67.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Draconic Core"
	quest.433F4124E447AC67.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eCore of Absolute Draconic Power"
	quest.442BD0BB5FB07B88.quest_desc: ["&fAmong the rewards left behind by the defeated &aEnder Guardian &flies the powerful &aGauntlet of Guard, &fa weapon infused with the forces of the void and gravity itself. When activated, the gauntlet can pull nearby &acreatures &ftoward you, disrupting enemy movement and creating powerful opportunities during combat. Though it may not appear overwhelmingly destructive at first glance, skilled adventurers can use this artifact as a highly &atactical tool &fto control dangerous encounters and manipulate the battlefield to their advantage."]
	quest.442BD0BB5FB07B88.quest_subtitle: "&7Claim the power of gravity"
	quest.442BD0BB5FB07B88.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eHands of the Collapsing Void"
	quest.447E235880BD83C8.quest_desc: ["&fCreated from the &aBasic Energy Relay Crystal, &fthe &aBasic Energy I/O Crystals &fserve as essential components for building stable draconic energy networks. These crystals allow energy to flow between generators, relay systems and machines requiring power. Depending on their configuration, they can function either as &aOutput &fcrystals, absorbing energy from generators, or as &aInput &fcrystals, transferring stored energy into connected components and devices."]
	quest.447E235880BD83C8.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Basic Energy I/O Crystals"
	quest.447E235880BD83C8.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eFlow of Controlled Energy"
	quest.45E5235FCCF252AF.quest_desc: ["&fAs draconic technology continues to evolve, more advanced fusion processes become necessary. The &aWyvern Fusion Crafting Injector &fserves as the core component for second-tier fusion crafting, allowing access to significantly stronger tools, machines and technological components. Crafting this injector requires the powerful &aWyvern Core &falongside several advanced materials, marking an important milestone in your progression through &aDraconic Engineering."]
	quest.45E5235FCCF252AF.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Wyvern Fusion Injector"
	quest.45E5235FCCF252AF.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eAscending Beyond Basic Fusion"
	quest.46F41C128CB48E1A.quest_desc: [
		"&f&oFind a Foliaath in lush biomes and defeat it."
		"&f&oTry to obtain a Foliaath Seed from its drops."
	]
	quest.46F41C128CB48E1A.quest_subtitle: "&7The carnivorous plant of the jungle"
	quest.46F41C128CB48E1A.title: "&f&lHunt the Foliaath"
	quest.472F00A70A716246.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Chaotic Pickaxe"
	quest.472F00A70A716246.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eBreaker of Worlds"
	quest.4752E98FA4F001CB.quest_desc: ["&fForged from the remains of the defeated &aHarbinger, &fthe &aWither Assault Shoulder Weapon &fis an incredibly destructive ranged weapon capable of launching explosive projectile rockets at enemies from a distance. Each shot detonates violently upon impact, making the weapon highly effective against groups of enemies and dangerous bosses alike. While powerful, its explosive force also requires careful aim and positioning during combat to avoid unnecessary danger."]
	quest.4752E98FA4F001CB.quest_subtitle: "&7Obtain the Wither Assault Shoulder Weapon"
	quest.4752E98FA4F001CB.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eShoulder Cannon of Ruin"
	quest.4763E0B584C7E7E7.quest_desc: ["&fAmong the treasures claimed from the defeated &aLeviathan &frests the powerful &aTidal Claws, &fa unique tool capable of drastically improving mobility during combat and exploration. These mystical claws can be used as a &ahook, &fpulling you toward distant surfaces or launching you away from danger depending on how they are used. Their effectiveness depends on distance and proper timing, so understanding their &arange &fis essential to mastering them. In battle, the Tidal Claws provide incredible agility, allowing skilled adventurers to escape devastating attacks that would otherwise mean certain death."]
	quest.4763E0B584C7E7E7.quest_subtitle: "&7Master movement through the abyss"
	quest.4763E0B584C7E7E7.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eClaws of the Tides"
	quest.47C1F842E9339F31.quest_desc: [
		"&f&oFind a skittering Grottol below Y=25 and capture it."
		"&f&oMine it with Silk Touch to obtain a Captured Grottol."
	]
	quest.47C1F842E9339F31.quest_subtitle: "&7The living ore deep underground"
	quest.47C1F842E9339F31.title: "&f&lCatch the Grottol"
	quest.48A79DA634AF47C7.quest_desc: [
		""
		"HP: &2&l25&f&r  "
		"Spawns: &6&lIn deep oceans&f&r  "
		"Melee: &6&lSummons The Rabidus&f&r  "
		"Speed: &8&lSedentary&f&r  "
		""
		"Special Abilities:  "
		"- Summons a &7&lcaged Rabidus&f&r on the target's head, turning them into a &c&lhost&f&r.  "
		"- After attacking or being attacked, it &6&lcloses its coffin&f&r to &2&lrecharge its power&f&r.  "
		"- Its &7&lcoffin&f&r is resistant to any &8&lphysical attack&f&r.  "
		""
		"Tip:  "
		"- The mob &c&lcannot attack&f&r while its coffin is &7&lshut&f&r.  "
		"- Making a &7&lcage&f&r fall onto the mob's head will &4&lkill it instantly&f&r."
	]
	quest.48A79DA634AF47C7.quest_subtitle: "&lKill The Possessive (Illager Constructs)"
	quest.48A79DA634AF47C7.title: "&8&lKill The Possessive"
	quest.48F46166A6AE8A29.quest_desc: ["&fAt the center of the &aRuined Citadel &fawaits the terrifying &aEnder Guardian, &fan ancient protector empowered by the forces of the void. While its attacks may appear slow, the creature possesses devastating strength capable of trapping and overwhelming careless adventurers in seconds. Facing this boss without the proper &atools and preparation &fcan quickly lead to disaster. Stay mobile, remain alert, and avoid being caught within its crushing attacks if you wish to survive the battle."]
	quest.48F46166A6AE8A29.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat the Ender Guardian"
	quest.48F46166A6AE8A29.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eWatcher of the Ruined Throne"
	quest.49355A7EC257C5CB.quest_desc: ["Generates Source from nearby food, with Source Berry food providing more Source. The Mycelial Sourcelink converts Grass or Dirt into Mycelium and grows mushrooms when the space is empty. It also pulls items from nearby pedestals."]
	quest.49355A7EC257C5CB.quest_subtitle: "Source from Food and Growth."
	quest.4971F28E56F801A8.quest_desc: [
		"&fFusion Crafting requires enormous amounts of &aenergy &fto function correctly. In order for the fusion process to begin, the &aFusion Crafting Core &fand connected injectors must receive sufficient power through generators, energy crystals and connected draconic energy networks. Without proper energy management, even the simplest fusion recipes will remain inactive. Refer to the demonstration image for an example of a properly powered fusion setup."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/images/fusionenergy.png width:120 height:80 align:center}"
	]
	quest.4971F28E56F801A8.quest_subtitle: "&7Supply energy to the fusion system"
	quest.4971F28E56F801A8.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&ePowering the Fusion Core"
	quest.4BDF46CB9D09270A.quest_desc: ["&fForged from the cursed remains of &aMaledictus, &fthe legendary &aCursed Bow &fis a terrifying ranged weapon capable of unleashing devastating attacks upon distant enemies. Infused with dark energy and immense destructive power, this weapon reflects the deadly combat style once wielded by the ruler of the &aFrosted Prison &fitself."]
	quest.4BDF46CB9D09270A.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Cursed Bow"
	quest.4BDF46CB9D09270A.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eBow of the Cursed King"
	quest.4BF8EDE4DD0A5725.quest_desc: ["&fUsing the power contained within the &aDraconium Core, &fadventurers can craft the advanced &aWyvern Energy Core, &fa vital component used throughout mid-tier draconic technology. This powerful energy controller is required for second-tier fusion crafting, advanced energy crystals and future high-level energy systems. In addition, it serves as the foundation for crafting even stronger controllers in later stages of progression."]
	quest.4BF8EDE4DD0A5725.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Wyvern Energy Core"
	quest.4BF8EDE4DD0A5725.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eController of Flowing Energy"
	quest.4CAB68CAF6E2D445.quest_desc: ["&fYou've heard that some of the Nether's creatures drop a special kind of dust. It glows with a faint light, a sign of its connection to the fire that burns there. To obtain this &c&lglowing dust&r&f, you must venture into the fiery dimension and defeat these fiery creatures."]
	quest.4CAB68CAF6E2D445.quest_subtitle: "&lA ethereal gift from the realm of fire"
	quest.4CAB68CAF6E2D445.title: "&8&lLight of the Fire"
	quest.4E7891406F9E319F.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Wyvern Chestpiece"
	quest.4E7891406F9E319F.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eHeartguard of the Wyvern"
	quest.50EB2B74D14391F4.quest_desc: [
		""
		"HP: &2&l80&f&r"
		"Spawns: &6&lIn caves&f&r"
		"Special: &6&lBig variant&f&r that spawns underground with more &2&lhealth&f&r and better &2&ldrops&f&r."
		""
		"Note:"
		"They usually spawn in &6&lhuge groups&f&r, making an appearance with a &c&ldeafening flapping sound&f&r."
		"In most situations, &e&lavoidance&f&r is the preferable option."
	]
	quest.50EB2B74D14391F4.quest_subtitle: "&lKill The Bigger Suck"
	quest.50EB2B74D14391F4.title: "&8&lKill The Bigger Suck"
	quest.5157AD63A444E1A5.quest_desc: ["This mod adds vicious undead mobs that turn Minecraft into a real challenge. The new enemies are pretty scary, and sometimes running is smarter than fighting, but each zombie has a hidden &2&lweakness&f&r you can exploit to bring them down with ease."]
	quest.5157AD63A444E1A5.quest_subtitle: "&lWelcome to The Undead Revamped Mod"
	quest.5157AD63A444E1A5.title: "&c&lWelcome to The Undead Revamped"
	quest.529F6326ACDBCBC5.quest_desc: ["&fAcross the world lie forgotten &astructures, &fancient ruins and deadly dungeons hiding unimaginable &apower. &fWithin them sleep colossal bosses capable of destroying unprepared adventurers. &fTo uncover these places, special &aEyes &fmust first be crafted, each one guiding its bearer toward a specific dungeon or ancient domain. &fPrepare your gear carefully, for the challenges ahead mark the beginning of a true &acataclysm."]
	quest.529F6326ACDBCBC5.quest_subtitle: "&7Face the ancient horrors of the world"
	quest.529F6326ACDBCBC5.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eCataclysm Rising"
	quest.5367ED72A1BF23F3.quest_desc: ["&fAmong the flooded pathways of the &aAcropolis &fhide aggressive &aUrchinkins, &fsmall but dangerous creatures capable of overwhelming careless adventurers in groups. Though individually weak, defeating at least &afive &fof them will help secure the outer sections of the structure before venturing deeper into the storm-covered ruins."]
	quest.5367ED72A1BF23F3.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat the Urchinkins"
	quest.5367ED72A1BF23F3.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eSpikes Beneath the Waves"
	quest.53C837D4FD70CD4B.quest_desc: [
		"&f&oFind a Wrought Chamber and wake the Ferrous Wroughtnaut."
		"&f&oDefeat it and claim the Axe of a Thousand Metals and Wrought Helm."
	]
	quest.53C837D4FD70CD4B.quest_subtitle: "&7Awaken the iron juggernaut in its chamber"
	quest.53C837D4FD70CD4B.title: "&f&lChallenge the Ferrous Wroughtnaut"
	quest.5433D5692AEEAA44.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Chaotic Hoe"
	quest.5433D5692AEEAA44.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eCultivator of Ruin"
	quest.54467A18A3F1038F.quest_desc: ["&fA master blacksmith is seeking the legendary &c&lDark Metal&r&f, a material of immense power found only in the deepest, most corrupted parts of the world. It is said to be the very essence of chaos, and you must brave the darkness to acquire it for him."]
	quest.54467A18A3F1038F.quest_subtitle: "&lA legendary material forged in darkness"
	quest.54467A18A3F1038F.title: "&8&lForge of Shadows"
	quest.548BA76AC8601444.quest_desc: ["This is a brazier that can be used as decoration or to perform rituals on it, look carefully at the color of the spells."]
	quest.548BA76AC8601444.quest_subtitle: "Is it for decoration or rituals?."
	quest.54C5D5FB6DB6C751.quest_desc: ["&fSituational awareness can often decide the outcome of combat before the first shot is fired. The &aBinoculars &fallow adventurers to observe distant areas and identify threats, structures or movement far beyond normal visual range. In addition to reconnaissance, these tactical optics can also be used to &amark distant targets, &fmaking them highly valuable for coordinated combat operations and long-range battlefield awareness within &aAlliance of Valiant Arms."]
	quest.54C5D5FB6DB6C751.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft Binoculars"
	quest.54C5D5FB6DB6C751.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eEyes Across the Battlefield"
	quest.55165252DF9D37CD.quest_desc: [
		"&fMany advanced military devices and firearm components require reliable mechanical systems to function correctly. The &aSpring &fserves as one of the fundamental industrial parts used throughout &aAlliance of Valiant Arms, &facting as a core ingredient for crafting more complex materials such as &aFuses &fand &aMechanical Components. &fThough simple in appearance, this small component becomes essential for the production of increasingly advanced weaponry and tactical equipment."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/images/spring.png width:100 height:55 align:center}"
	]
	quest.55165252DF9D37CD.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft Springs"
	quest.55165252DF9D37CD.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eMechanical Compression Systems"
	quest.5581CDC05059982F.quest_desc: ["&fWandering the burning halls of the &aBurning Arena &fare the dangerous &aIgnited Revenants, &fcursed warriors consumed by eternal flames. Defeating at least &atwo &fof these creatures is essential, as they drop the valuable &aBurning Ashes &frequired to awaken the ruler of the arena itself. Gathering multiple ashes is highly recommended, since additional summons may later be necessary to obtain more materials and rewards from future battles against the dungeon's terrifying boss."]
	quest.5581CDC05059982F.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat the Ignited Revenants"
	quest.5581CDC05059982F.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eAshes of the Fallen Flame"
	quest.568165BED3FA682A.quest_desc: ["&fPatrolling the submerged areas of the &aAcropolis &fare the swift and dangerous &aHippocamtus, &fcreatures capable of rapidly closing distance against careless explorers. Their speed and constant movement make them difficult targets during combat. Defeating at least &afive &fof these enemies is recommended before challenging the greater threats hidden within the ruins."]
	quest.568165BED3FA682A.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat the Hippocamtus"
	quest.568165BED3FA682A.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eRiders of the Drowned Current"
	quest.57159EA0FB597208.quest_desc: ["&fBy combining the destructive power of the &aInfernal Forge &fwith advanced void technology through the &aMechanical Fusion Anvil, &fadventurers can create the legendary &aVoid Forge. &fThis terrifying weapon retains the devastating area attacks of its previous form while further amplifying its raw destructive potential through unstable void energy. Both a weapon and a mining tool, the Void Forge stands among the most powerful creations obtainable during this stage of progression."]
	quest.57159EA0FB597208.quest_subtitle: "&7Upgrade the Infernal Forge"
	quest.57159EA0FB597208.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eHammer of the Collapsing Void"
	quest.574EA08AEAD8D669.quest_desc: [
		"&fTo begin progressing through the world of &aAlliance of Valiant Arms, &fadventurers must first construct the essential &aA.V.A Crafting Table. &fThis advanced military workstation serves as the primary station for crafting modern weaponry, tactical equipment, ammunition, explosives and combat utilities. Nearly every firearm, grenade and combat-related item within the mod will require this table at some stage, making it the true foundation of all future military progression."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/images/craftingtable.png width:100 height:55 align:center}"
	]
	quest.574EA08AEAD8D669.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the A.V.A Crafting Table"
	quest.574EA08AEAD8D669.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eFoundations of Modern Warfare"
	quest.579F554FA3B1C32D.quest_desc: ["&fAmong the first truly advanced utility devices within &aDraconic Engineering &fstands the impressive &aDraconium Chest, &fa massive storage artifact capable of holding enormous quantities of items far beyond ordinary containers. In addition to its vast storage capacity, the chest includes an integrated &acrafting interface &fand an internal &asmelting system &fthat can process materials directly from within the chest itself. The smelting functions require stored energy to operate, making generators and energy systems essential for maintaining its functionality. Furthermore, the chest can be upgraded using an energy &acapacitor, &fallowing it to store greater amounts of portable energy for extended operation."]
	quest.579F554FA3B1C32D.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Draconium Chest"
	quest.579F554FA3B1C32D.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eVault of Draconic Storage"
	quest.57E8DBB24BB2D2E1.quest_desc: [
		"&fAmong the valuable remains left behind by the &aNetherite Monstrosity &fare mysterious &aLava Power Cells, &fstrange energy cores capable of bringing dormant creatures to life. Deep inside the treasure chamber of the &aSoul Black Smith &frest small inactive &aMinistrosities, &fwaiting to be activated. Once awakened, these companions can carry and store your &aitems, &fmaking them valuable allies during exploration. They will not naturally follow you, but they can be transported safely inside a &abucket &fand commanded to sit or stand through interaction."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/images/minimonstrosity.png width:120 height:80 align:center}"
	]
	quest.57E8DBB24BB2D2E1.quest_subtitle: "&7Awaken the loyal Minimonstrosity"
	quest.57E8DBB24BB2D2E1.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eFlames Given Life"
	quest.58C845255A8D3BE3.quest_desc: [
		"&fManaging draconic energy networks requires proper control over how energy is transferred between crystals and machines. The &aCrystal Binder &fserves as the essential tool used to link and direct energy connections. To use it, first select the crystal that will output energy by sneaking and right-clicking it. Once selected, the crystal will display a &agreen cube &findicating it as the active source. Afterward, simply right-click the receiving crystal or compatible component to establish the energy connection and begin transferring power."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/images/2026-05-16_12.13.49.png width:120 height:80 align:center}"
	]
	quest.58C845255A8D3BE3.quest_subtitle: "&7Learn to use the Crystal Binder"
	quest.58C845255A8D3BE3.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eDirecting the Flow of Energy"
	quest.5A50E6E0D11BDE41.quest_desc: ["&fForged using materials obtained from the defeated &aScylla, &fthe legendary &aCeraunus &fis a powerful weapon infused with the destructive force of storms and lightning. Its immense offensive power makes it highly effective during difficult encounters, rewarding aggressive adventurers capable of mastering its devastating potential in battle."]
	quest.5A50E6E0D11BDE41.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft Ceraunus"
	quest.5A50E6E0D11BDE41.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eWrath of the Thunder Sea"
	quest.5BBD8DE769B24618.quest_desc: ["&fDeep within the drowned chambers of the &aSunken City &fwanders the dangerous &aDeepling Priest, &fa twisted servant of abyssal rituals and forgotten gods. Defeating this creature grants the rare &aAthame, &fa ceremonial blade infused with dark power that is required for crafting the &aAbyssal Sacrifice. &fWithout it, the ritual to awaken the ancient creature beneath the ocean cannot be completed."]
	quest.5BBD8DE769B24618.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat the Deepling Priest"
	quest.5BBD8DE769B24618.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eKeeper of the Cursed Blade"
	quest.5C64C15F14A7B18E.quest_desc: ["&fA new boss has appeared! &c&lLord Pumpkinhead&r&f, a strengthened version of Sir Pumpkinhead, is a formidable late-game challenge. You can summon him by using a &c&lTransmuting Elixir&r&f on an &c&lInfernal Evil Pumpkin&r&f. Be prepared for a challenging multi-stage fight with powerful new attacks like &c&lSoul Stratification&r&f, &c&lInfernal Flame&r&f, and the &c&lLiving Bomb curse&r&f."]
	quest.5C64C15F14A7B18E.quest_subtitle: "&lThe ultimate pumpkin entity has risen"
	quest.5C64C15F14A7B18E.title: "&8&lLord Pumpkin Head"
	quest.5CCA6E636D4D80A6.quest_desc: ["&fAn even more terrifying presence has been born from the ashes of a Pumpkin Spirit. A &c&lSeared Spirit&r&f is a tormented creature, summoned when its ghostly counterpart is consumed by flames. It burns with an unending rage, leaving a trail of fiery destruction wherever it glides. You must &c&lextinguish its unholy fire&r&f and put an end to its &c&ldestructive path&r&f."]
	quest.5CCA6E636D4D80A6.quest_subtitle: "&lBorn from ashes, fueled by unholy fire"
	quest.5CCA6E636D4D80A6.title: "&8&lA Seared Spirit"
	quest.5D1A701DB64F348B.quest_desc: ["&fHidden beneath the unstable &aChaos Islands &flie the legendary &aChaos Shards, &fextremely valuable materials infused with overwhelming chaotic energy. These shards are indispensable for all fourth-tier &aChaos Fusion &frecipes and will become one of the rarest and most important resources throughout endgame progression. Because Chaos Shards do not exist in large quantities, adventurers may need to search for additional chaos deposits and confront multiple &aChaos Guardians &fto gather enough material for future creations. Larger shards can also be broken down into smaller fragments for use in various advanced crafting recipes."]
	quest.5D1A701DB64F348B.quest_subtitle: "&7Obtain Chaos Shards"
	quest.5D1A701DB64F348B.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eFragments of Pure Chaos"
	quest.5DF99D29556D2F3A.quest_desc: ["&fCountless ordinary &aDraugr &fwander throughout the frozen corridors of the &aFrosted Prison, &fcreating constant pressure for adventurers attempting to survive within the cursed structure. Though weaker than their elite counterparts, their numbers alone make them dangerous during prolonged fights. Defeating at least &afive &fof these undead warriors is necessary to clear the road toward the prison's deepest chambers."]
	quest.5DF99D29556D2F3A.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat the Draugr"
	quest.5DF99D29556D2F3A.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eMarch of the Restless Dead"
	quest.5EFF187EE39FB4AE.quest_desc: ["&fAt the heart of the &aAcropolis &fawaits the terrifying &aScylla, &fa monstrous ruler of storms and oceanic destruction. This battle becomes extremely dangerous for adventurers who remain stationary for too long, as the creature relentlessly pressures its enemies with fast attacks and deadly abilities. Constant movement, awareness and proper positioning are essential for surviving this encounter against one of the most dangerous sea-born horrors."]
	quest.5EFF187EE39FB4AE.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat Scylla"
	quest.5EFF187EE39FB4AE.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eThe Storm That Never Sleeps"
	quest.5F5A8307645E76C5.quest_desc: [
		""
		"HP: &2&l30&f&r  "
		"Spawns: &6&lAnywhere in the Overworld&f&r  "
		"Speed: &6&lBoing Boing&f&r  "
		""
		"Special Abilities:  "
		"- Jumps toward the &c&ltarget&f&r, slamming its big &e&llightning rod&f&r down on its prey. This attack can be &6&lblocked&f&r.  "
		"- You can &6&lknock&f&r or &6&lparry&f&r them back while they are mid-air using long-ranged weapons like a &2&lcrossbow&f&r or &2&lbow&f&r.  "
		"- You can also &6&lblock their attacks&f&r by sending them back.  "
		""
		"Weakness:  "
		"- They die instantly if exposed to &9&lthundering weather&f&r.  "
		"- When killed by a &e&llightning strike&f&r, they drop &7&lpiles of ashes&f&r, which you can right-click to get &8&lgunpowder&f&r and &a&lXP&f&r."
	]
	quest.5F5A8307645E76C5.quest_subtitle: "&lKill The Rod (Illagers Construct)"
	quest.5F5A8307645E76C5.title: "&8&lKill The Rod"
	quest.601CBA1445E7D6F1.quest_desc: [
		"&fLightweight but highly versatile, &aFibre &fserves as an important manufacturing material throughout &aAlliance of Valiant Arms. &fThis reinforced synthetic resource is commonly used in the production of weapon lenses, ammunition components and various types of tactical equipment. Due to its flexibility and durability, fibre becomes a recurring requirement for both combat gear and advanced firearm construction."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/images/fibre.png width:100 height:55 align:center}"
	]
	quest.601CBA1445E7D6F1.quest_subtitle: "&7Produce Fibre"
	quest.601CBA1445E7D6F1.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eReinforced Synthetic Fibres"
	quest.6030DECFC9976C15.quest_desc: ["&fForged using the rare &aIgnitium Ingots &fobtained from the defeated &aIgnis, &fthe legendary &aThe Incinerator &fis one of the most destructive greatswords obtainable during this stage of progression. Infused with immense fire power, this massive blade is capable of unleashing devastating attacks against enemies unfortunate enough to stand before it. Crafting this weapon often requires defeating Ignis several times to gather enough materials for its creation."]
	quest.6030DECFC9976C15.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft The Incinerator"
	quest.6030DECFC9976C15.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eBlade Born from Inferno"
	quest.610C5E12937D85BB.quest_desc: [
		"&fBeyond transportation, &aPoint-to-Point Dislocator Portals &fcan also be used for advanced draconic energy transmission across any distance or dimension. To achieve this, a powered setup must first be connected using a &aBasic Energy I/O Crystal &fdirected toward the &aDislocator Receptacle &fon one side of the portal. On the opposite portal, a &aBasic Wireless Energy Crystal &fcan then receive the transmitted energy and distribute it directly into nearby machines or energy storage systems. Through this method, entire draconic infrastructures can share energy instantly across massive distances."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/images/energyportal.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.610C5E12937D85BB.quest_subtitle: "&7Transmit power using Point-to-Point portals"
	quest.610C5E12937D85BB.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eEnergy Through Dimensional Gateways"
	quest.610E7FA62E30B5A4.quest_desc: ["&fAmong the greatest treasures obtainable from the &aAcropolis &frests the mighty &aAstrape, &fa legendary weapon empowered by violent storm energy. Built for powerful and relentless combat, this weapon channels the fury of thunder itself against enemies. In the hands of a skilled warrior, Astrape becomes a devastating tool capable of dominating even the most dangerous encounters ahead."]
	quest.610E7FA62E30B5A4.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft Astrape"
	quest.610E7FA62E30B5A4.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eSpear of the Living Storm"
	quest.612A0A2B5501BC58.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Draconic Sword"
	quest.612A0A2B5501BC58.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eDragon Slayer's Edge"
	quest.6227DD514BCA30FA.quest_desc: ["&fThe final frontier of your journey awaits. A realm of floating islands and enigmatic creatures, it is a place few dare to venture. You must seek out the &c&lportal&r&f, face its &c&lguardians&r&f, and step into the &c&labyss&r&f to prove your courage."]
	quest.6227DD514BCA30FA.quest_subtitle: "&lThe ultimate test of strength awaits"
	quest.6227DD514BCA30FA.title: "&8&lA Journey to the End"
	quest.6317443877E37660.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Chaotic Sword"
	quest.6317443877E37660.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eBlade of Absolute Chaos"
	quest.635CA51A84946ABE.quest_desc: ["This device adds new enchantments and also enhances existing ones, using a font and items. To make it work, simply add the items from the selected spell."]
	quest.635CA51A84946ABE.quest_subtitle: "Don't worry, I'll help you how to do it."
	quest.635CA51A84946ABE.title: "How to enchant?"
	quest.63B0C37189B38E92.quest_desc: [
		"&fAs military technology advances, traditional materials alone become insufficient for modern equipment manufacturing. By processing and smelting &aLeather, &fadventurers can obtain &aPlastic, &fa versatile synthetic material used extensively throughout &aAlliance of Valiant Arms. &fPlastic becomes an important component for crafting firearms, tactical equipment and chemical resources such as the valuable &aAcetone Solution, &fmaking it a resource that will remain useful throughout all stages of progression."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/images/plastic.png width:100 height:60 align:center}"
	]
	quest.63B0C37189B38E92.quest_subtitle: "&7Produce Plastic"
	quest.63B0C37189B38E92.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eSynthetic Combat Materials"
	quest.6623D1FCDD0A1964.quest_desc: [
		"&fNot every firearm component relies purely on metal and industrial alloys. Through specialized compression processes, adventurers can create &aCompressed Wood, &fa reinforced material used in the manufacturing of various firearms and tactical equipment within &aAlliance of Valiant Arms. &fIts durability and lightweight structure make it especially useful for weapon frames, grips and other military constructions."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/images/wood.png width:100 height:55 align:center}"
	]
	quest.6623D1FCDD0A1964.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft Compressed Wood"
	quest.6623D1FCDD0A1964.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eCompressed Tactical Materials"
	quest.66F71F7D4CCE9DC9.quest_desc: ["The fountain is used to power rituals or infusion chambers as well as the enchantment apparatus, for this you will need to generate a lot of fountain with the following generators below."]
	quest.66F71F7D4CCE9DC9.quest_subtitle: "It is used to store the source."
	quest.66FCAED7729A06E0.quest_desc: [
		"The Imbuement Chamber is a magical device used to imbue items with enchantments and magical properties in Ars Nouveau."
		"Source Gems are magical crystals used as a key ingredient for crafting spells and magical items in Ars Nouveau."
	]
	quest.66FCAED7729A06E0.quest_subtitle: "You will need to learn how to create and then automate gems, you will need them quite a bit."
	quest.66FCAED7729A06E0.title: "Create your first Source gems"
	quest.675E886D54AF9D8B.quest_desc: [
		""
		"HP: &2&l50&f&r"
		"Spawns: &6&lY≥78 in the Overworld&f&r or in &6&lsnowy biomes&f&r"
		"Attack: &2&l2-5&f&r"
		""
		"Special Abilities:"
		"- &4&lOverhead swing&f&r (2 damage): if the player is too close, it starts &6&lspamming its axe&f&r and may chain into a &4&lside swing&f&r."
		"- &4&lSide swing&f&r (4 damage): a wide sweep to the left or right that can &6&lcatch you off guard&f&r."
		"- &3&lWind magic&f&r (2 damage): summons a &3&lwindy blade&f&r that &6&lfollows you&f&r and can be either &2&lblocked&f&r or &4&ldestroyed&f&r."
		""
		"Notes:"
		"- Both &6&lWolf&f&r and &6&lBruin&f&r drop &b&lBostrox&f&r, which crafts into &2&lvery strong armor&f&r and grants a &2&lstrength buff&f&r."
		"- The downside: you become &8&lslower when walking&f&r and take &c&lextra damage&f&r if you are &6&lrunning&f&r."
		"- &b&lBostrox ore&f&r can also be found naturally in the &2&llush cave"
	]
	quest.675E886D54AF9D8B.quest_subtitle: "&lKill The Wolf (Vikings)"
	quest.675E886D54AF9D8B.title: "&8&lKill The Wolf"
	quest.67B620144D289E0C.quest_desc: ["&fThe deeper regions of the &aAcropolis &fare infested with dangerous &aSymbioctos, &funnatural creatures fused together through strange oceanic corruption. Their unpredictable attacks and mobility make them dangerous opponents for adventurers exploring the ruins. Defeating at least &afive &fof these monsters will greatly reduce the threats surrounding the path toward the dungeon's true ruler."]
	quest.67B620144D289E0C.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat the Symbioctos"
	quest.67B620144D289E0C.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eSymbiotic Horrors"
	quest.6827840C0258F44C.quest_desc: [
		""
		"HP: &2&l200&f&r  "
		"Spawns: &6&lAnywhere in the Overworld&f&r  "
		"Speed: &6&lFast&f&r  "
		""
		"Attacks and Damages  "
		"- Smash: &2&l6&f&r + sends you &c&lflying&f&r.  "
		"- CounterPunch: &2&l5&f&r + &4&lKnockback&f&r.  "
		"- Stone Throwing: &2&l8&f&r + &4&lFire&f&r + &4&lArea damage&f&r.  "
		"- Stone Smash: &2&l8&f&r + sends you flying + &c&lUNBLOCKABLE&f&r.  "
		"- Stone Crashing Smash: &2&l8&f&r + sends you flying + &4&lFire&f&r + &8&lSlowness affliction&f&r + &c&lUNBLOCKABLE&f&r.  "
		"- Roar: &2&l0&f&r + &c&lscreen-locks&f&r the player for a second + summons &6&l10 Fire Crackles&f&r + sends nearby entities (not players) flying.  "
		""
		"Special Abilities  "
		"- The Heavy can &6&lblock&f&r your attacks and follow up with a &4&lcounter punch&f&r.  "
		"- If you stay too &c&lclose&f&r while he is blocking, you will be knocked back when you try to attack.  "
		"- He will start using a &4&lroaring attack&f&r if you abuse his blocking frames.  "
		"- Once he has picked up a &7&lboulder&f&r, it can be smashed &2&l3 times&f&r before breaking, spreading &4&lflaming area damage&f&r; a thrown boulder breaks instantly.  "
		"- He takes &8&lno damage&f&r while roaring.  "
		"- Despite his fire attacks, he is &2&lnot immune&f&r to &4&lfire&f&r.  "
		""
		"Notes  "
		"- The &4&lFire Attack Buff&f&r applies to every type of damage, including &6&lprojectiles&f&r or full sword swings, inflicting &4&lburns&f&r on multiple enemies.  "
		"- You can &6&lcut his arm off&f&r to weaken his blocks and counterpunches. Attack him right after a counter punch, but be prepared for the &c&lconsequences&f&r."
	]
	quest.6827840C0258F44C.quest_subtitle: "&lKill The Heavy / The Grappler (True Zombie + Fire Dust)"
	quest.6827840C0258F44C.title: "&8&lKill The Heavy / The Grappler"
	quest.68D3EA83F0C70401.quest_desc: ["&fTo maintain consistent battlefield operations, adventurers can craft the versatile &aAmmo Kit, &fa universal ammunition supply package containing up to &a200 rounds &fusable with nearly any firearm within &aAlliance of Valiant Arms. &fIts flexibility makes it one of the most practical ammunition resources for extended combat encounters and exploration missions."]
	quest.68D3EA83F0C70401.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Ammo Kit"
	quest.68D3EA83F0C70401.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eUniversal Combat Supplies"
	quest.69B02D7DDE6F2B34.quest_desc: ["Generates Source by consuming potions from nearby potion jars. The amount of Source varies depending on the potion's complexity. Bonus Source is provided for longer and more complex potions. Utilizing Wixies and Potion Melders is recommended for creating complex potions."]
	quest.69B02D7DDE6F2B34.quest_subtitle: "Potion-Based Source Generation."
	quest.69B2409254A5682F.quest_desc: ["&fLurking within the dark corridors of the &aAncient Factory &fis the terrifying &aProwler, &fa corrupted machine built solely for destruction. Its brutal attacks and mechanical resilience make it far more dangerous than the lesser constructs roaming the structure. Though considered a secondary target, defeating this creature is highly recommended to reduce the dangers surrounding the path toward the factory's true master."]
	quest.69B2409254A5682F.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat The Prowler"
	quest.69B2409254A5682F.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eHunter of Broken Steel"
	quest.69DB8C20E037983E.quest_desc: [
		"&fAs weapon manufacturing becomes increasingly advanced, specialized synthetic materials become essential for modern firearm construction. &aSilicon &fserves as an important industrial component used throughout &aAlliance of Valiant Arms &ffor crafting various weapons and technological firearm parts. Its refined properties make it valuable for producing reliable and efficient military equipment capable of handling demanding combat conditions."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/images/silicon.png width:100 height:55 align:center}"
	]
	quest.69DB8C20E037983E.quest_subtitle: "&7Produce Silicon"
	quest.69DB8C20E037983E.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eAdvanced Synthetic Components"
	quest.6A8720FF22F80482.quest_desc: ["&fAs draconic technology continues to evolve, efficient energy transportation becomes increasingly important. The &aBasic Energy Relay Crystal &fserves as a wireless intermediary capable of receiving energy from generators and redirecting it across connected draconic crystal networks. These crystals act as the central links between power sources and other energy components, allowing stable distribution throughout your growing infrastructure. By combining relay crystals with &aInput &fand &aOutput Crystals, adventurers can create complex energy systems capable of powering machines, fusion crafting setups and advanced draconic devices."]
	quest.6A8720FF22F80482.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Basic Energy Relay Crystal"
	quest.6A8720FF22F80482.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eCrystals of Energy Transmission"
	quest.6A94CF1827C3F16E.quest_desc: ["&fA new danger lurks in the waters. The &c&lThornshell Crab&r&f is a tough crustacean, its body protected by a thick, spiky shell that makes it difficult to damage. You must find and defeat this creature to prove your strength and protect the local waterways."]
	quest.6A94CF1827C3F16E.quest_subtitle: "&lA dangerous crustacean lurks beneath the waves"
	quest.6A94CF1827C3F16E.title: "&8&lFrickly Problen"
	quest.6ABA3CEF4FF389CB.quest_desc: ["&fBy combining a &aDraconium Core, Draconium Ingots &fand the immense power of a &aNether Star, &fadventurers can create the advanced &aWyvern Core. &fThis powerful component represents a significant leap in draconic technology, unlocking access to stronger equipment, advanced machines and more complex fusion recipes. Compared to the basic Draconium Core, the Wyvern Core contains far greater draconic energy and serves as the foundation for mid-tier progression."]
	quest.6ABA3CEF4FF389CB.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft a Wyvern Core"
	quest.6ABA3CEF4FF389CB.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eCore Empowered by the Nether Star"
	quest.6ACF2F7B2DB3E480.quest_desc: ["&fWhispers of a cursed relic, the &c&lBone Heart&r&f, have reached your ears. This ancient artifact, said to be a remnant of a powerful skeletal sorcerer, offers a one-time ward against mortal blows."]
	quest.6ACF2F7B2DB3E480.quest_subtitle: "&lA relic of skeletal sorcery awaits"
	quest.6ACF2F7B2DB3E480.title: "&8&lThe Bone Heart"
	quest.6CCF30F85E57ADC0.quest_desc: ["&fOnce wielded by the cursed ruler &aMaledictus, &fthe legendary &aSoul Render &fis a dark weapon infused with forbidden energy and relentless power. Designed for aggressive combat, this terrifying blade embodies the brutality of the final boss itself and stands among the strongest weapons obtainable throughout your entire journey."]
	quest.6CCF30F85E57ADC0.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft Soul Render"
	quest.6CCF30F85E57ADC0.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eBlade That Devours Souls"
	quest.6DACAD03D5FB4C10.quest_desc: [
		""
		""
		"HP: &2&l8&f&r  "
		"Attack: &2&l4-30&f&r  "
		"Speed: &6&lSpeedy&f&r  "
		""
		"Special Ability: &2&lHides underground&f&r when there is no target, then pops up to spit &2&lacid&f&r from a distance.  "
		""
		"Notes: Their sight is worse than most zombies, so a &6&lbow&f&r works great before they notice you. Spitters have two &7&ltexture variants&f&r with burned clothes and mouth.  "
		""
		"Drops: They rarely drop an &2&lAcid Sack&f&r which you can throw to spread &2&lacid&f&r on impact. The Acid Sack can be combined with &a&lslime&f&r to make a &4&lNapalm Sack&f&r, or crafted into a bowl to gain &6&lDebuff resistance&f&r from eggs or snow. Right-clicking the bowl on &9&lwater&f&r will give you a &a&lrefreshing tea&f&r."
	]
	quest.6DACAD03D5FB4C10.quest_subtitle: "&lKill The Spitter (True Zombie)"
	quest.6DACAD03D5FB4C10.title: "&8&lKill The Spitter"
	quest.6E03B37B2E44969F.quest_desc: ["&fFar below the surface of the endless &aocean &flie the ruins of the forgotten &aSunken City, &fa drowned kingdom filled with ancient horrors and dark secrets. To uncover its location, adventurers must first craft the &aEye of the Abyss, &fa mysterious artifact capable of guiding its bearer toward the lost city. Within its flooded halls roam dangerous &amonsters &fguarding materials and rare drops essential for future progression. Their remains will later allow you to craft the item required to summon the terrible boss sleeping beneath the abyss, so prepare yourself carefully before descending into the depths."]
	quest.6E03B37B2E44969F.quest_subtitle: "&7Follow the Eye of the Abyss"
	quest.6E03B37B2E44969F.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eBeneath the Drowned Depths"
	quest.6E8E89BC40583526.quest_desc: [
		"&fSurvival in dangerous combat zones requires more than just powerful weapons. With the &aA.V.A Builder's Table, &fadventurers gain access to a wide variety of military construction blocks and structural components used for creating barricades, defensive positions, fortified bases and tactical battle environments. These structures can provide protection during monster encounters and help establish safer combat zones in hostile territory."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/images/buildertable.png width:100 height:55 align:center}"
	]
	quest.6E8E89BC40583526.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the A.V.A Builder's Table"
	quest.6E8E89BC40583526.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eEngineering the Battlefield"
	quest.6EEC1F68BA3BDE55.quest_desc: ["Unlock more powerful spells by upgrading your spellbook. "]
	quest.6EEC1F68BA3BDE55.quest_subtitle: "Upgrade your Novice Spellbook to tier 2 and tier 3."
	quest.6EEC1F68BA3BDE55.title: "Upgrade Your Spellbook"
	quest.6FDF02B000437A2D.quest_desc: [
		"&fModern combat equipment often relies on durable composite materials capable of resisting extreme impacts and battlefield conditions. Through industrial processing, adventurers can obtain &aCeramic Materials, &fa valuable resource used for crafting various types of protective equipment and tactical gear within &aAlliance of Valiant Arms. &fIts resilience makes it an important component for advanced military manufacturing and defensive technologies."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/images/ceramic.png width:100 height:55 align:center}"
	]
	quest.6FDF02B000437A2D.quest_subtitle: "&7Produce Ceramic Materials"
	quest.6FDF02B000437A2D.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eProtective Ceramic Composites"
	quest.704F7EF022499376.quest_desc: ["&fA twisted creation, the &c&lSiamese Skeletons&r&f, has been unleashed upon the land. These two wretched souls, fused together in a mockery of life, haunt the plains, their combined strength a force to be reckoned with. You must sever their &c&lcursed bond&r&f and send them back to the abyss from which they came."]
	quest.704F7EF022499376.quest_subtitle: "&lTwo cursed souls, bound by fate and malice"
	quest.704F7EF022499376.title: "&8&lSian's Final Stand"
	quest.70770F496FFFD59D.quest_desc: ["&fHidden somewhere within the &aOverworld &flies the abandoned &aAncient Factory, &fa massive mechanical structure filled with corrupted machines, forgotten experiments and unstable technology. To locate this dangerous facility, adventurers must first craft the &aEye of Mech, &fan artifact capable of guiding its bearer toward the ancient complex. Though many of its systems have long collapsed, powerful mechanical guardians still patrol its halls, protecting the secrets hidden deep within the factory."]
	quest.70770F496FFFD59D.quest_subtitle: "&7Follow the Eye of Mech"
	quest.70770F496FFFD59D.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eEchoes of the Ancient Machine"
	quest.71611A6906B633DB.quest_desc: ["&fAmong the flooded ruins hides the feared &aDeepling Warlock, &fa master of abyssal magic capable of overwhelming careless adventurers with dark attacks. Its presence protects the secrets of the &aSunken City, &fmaking it one of the many threats standing between you and the ritual needed to summon the sleeping horror below the ocean depths."]
	quest.71611A6906B633DB.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat the Deepling Warlock"
	quest.71611A6906B633DB.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eWhispers of the Abyss"
	quest.718730F4A53DE3B3.quest_desc: ["&fGuarding the ancient ruins beneath the sea stands the massive &aCoralssus, &fa colossal creature formed from hardened coral and abyssal energy. Though slow, its immense strength makes it a dangerous opponent for unprepared explorers. Upon defeat, the beast drops the valuable &aCoral Chunk, &fa rare material required for crafting the &aAbyssal Sacrifice. &fThis resource cannot be obtained through any other means."]
	quest.718730F4A53DE3B3.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat the Coralssus"
	quest.718730F4A53DE3B3.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eHeart of Living Coral"
	quest.71A074A15F72C62C.quest_desc: ["&fThe path to ultimate power lies beyond the mortal realm. You must build and activate a &c&lNether portal&r&f to unlock the gateway to the Abyss, a dimension teeming with dark magic and untold dangers. Gather the necessary materials and perform the ritual to open this &c&ldimensional gateway&r&f."]
	quest.71A074A15F72C62C.quest_subtitle: "&lAccess the realm of infinite darkness and torment"
	quest.71A074A15F72C62C.title: "&8&lGateway to the Abyss"
	quest.726D1E0C02328964.quest_desc: ["&fFor more advanced teleportation systems, adventurers can craft the &aUn-Bound Dislocator (Point-to-Point), &fa special draconic artifact created using &a2 Dislocators &fand a &aDraconium Core. &fUpon right-clicking while holding the device, it will split into two linked dislocators with a unique appearance different from conventional versions. These paired artifacts are designed specifically to interconnect &aDislocator Portals &fand &aPedestals, &fallowing the creation of stable two-way teleportation networks across vast distances and dimensions."]
	quest.726D1E0C02328964.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Un-Bound Dislocator (Point-to-Point)"
	quest.726D1E0C02328964.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eLinked Across Space"
	quest.726E98DE050EDBB2.quest_desc: [
		""
		"HP: &2&l95&f&r (alive) / &2&l120&f&r (corpse)"
		"Speed: &6&lBoing Boing&f&r"
		""
		"Attacks and Damages:"
		"- Body Slam: &2&l8&f&r + sends you &c&lflying&f&r (area damage)."
		"- Body Launching: &2&l12&f&r + &4&lknockback&f&r + small chance of &4&lexploding&f&r."
		"- &4&lSWALLOW&f&r: &2&l12&f&r + blockable + &c&lLOCK IN&f&r + &2&lGOO&f&r."
		"- &4&lROAR&f&r (at &2&l50 health&f&r): Increases its &4&lstrength&f&r and &8&lresistance&f&r."
		""
		"Special Abilities:"
		"- They do &8&lnot respawn or despawn&f&r, so you must travel further to find more."
		"- They live &6&lhidden underground&f&r, &c&lambushing their target&f&r."
		"- They leave a &7&lcorpse&f&r on death, attracting zombies in a &2&l20-block radius&f&r to destroy it (&2&l120 HP&f&r)."
		"- They sometimes stop chasing you mid-fight, then dig away and &8&ldespawn&f&r if ignored, forcing you to get closer (they are &8&lresistant to projectiles&f&r)."
		"- Drops &2&lhuge bones&f&r, &4&lflesh&f&r, &a&lslime&f&r and more once the corpse is destroyed, plus a &2&lgoo explosion&f&r inflicting goo effect."
		""
		"Tips:"
		"- &2&lTwo iron golems&f&r should be able to kill it."
		"- It is much easier to fight them in an &6&lopen area&f&r with no other &c&lmonsters&f&r nearby."
	]
	quest.726E98DE050EDBB2.quest_subtitle: "&lKill The Clogger / The Piggy (Demonic Undead)"
	quest.726E98DE050EDBB2.title: "&8&lKill The Clogger / The Piggy"
	quest.727A2CB75C74C9FF.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Draconic Shovel"
	quest.727A2CB75C74C9FF.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eEarthbreaker of the Ancients"
	quest.73D2E3304B67066F.quest_desc: ["&fThrough the power of the &aMechanical Fusion Anvil, &fthe &aGauntlet of Guard &fcan evolve into the terrifying &aGauntlet of Maelstrom. &fThis enhanced void weapon greatly amplifies its gravitational abilities, allowing its wielder to manipulate nearby enemies with far greater force and efficiency. In the hands of a skilled adventurer, the gauntlet becomes an extremely dangerous tactical weapon capable of controlling the battlefield during even the most difficult encounters."]
	quest.73D2E3304B67066F.quest_subtitle: "&7Upgrade the Gauntlet of Guard"
	quest.73D2E3304B67066F.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eGrasp of the Endless Storm"
	quest.73EAEBE3D66052DF.quest_desc: ["&fThe first step toward mastering advanced &aFusion Crafting &fcomes with the creation of the &aDraconium Fusion Crafting Injector. &fThis essential component forms the foundation of the first-tier fusion crafting system, allowing draconic energy to be channeled into complex recipes and technological creations. Through this tier of fusion, adventurers gain access to useful constructs such as the &aDraconium Chest &fand the more advanced &aWyvern Fusion Crafting Injector, &fmarking the beginning of increasingly powerful draconic engineering."]
	quest.73EAEBE3D66052DF.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Draconium Fusion Injector"
	quest.73EAEBE3D66052DF.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eFoundations of Fusion Crafting"
	quest.742E3BE1E29A174E.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Wyvern Hoe"
	quest.742E3BE1E29A174E.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eHarvest of Draconic Energy"
	quest.744018852485D0F6.quest_desc: ["&fRising above the coral reefs of the endless &aocean &fstands the mysterious &aAcropolis, &fan ancient structure consumed by storms and guarded by countless sea creatures. To uncover this dangerous location, adventurers must craft the &aEye of Storm, &fan artifact capable of guiding its bearer toward the floating ruins. Unlike many previous dungeons, the Acropolis is heavily populated with hostile enemies, making every corridor and platform a dangerous battlefield for unprepared explorers."]
	quest.744018852485D0F6.quest_subtitle: "&7Follow the Eye of Storm"
	quest.744018852485D0F6.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eCitadel Above the Tempest"
	quest.751CE709736FE6AB.quest_desc: [
		""
		"HP: &2&l16&f&r"
		"Spawns: &6&l78+ blocks above ground&f&r or underground"
		"Attack: &2&l4&f&r"
		"Speed: &6&lFast&f&r"
		""
		"Special Abilities:"
		"- Fully &2&lrecovers itself&f&r after dealing damage (unless the attack is &7&lblocked&f&r)."
		"- &6&lFlies&f&r to confuse its target or avoid getting hit."
		"- After dealing damage, it will &6&lmove/fly away&f&r for a second before coming back to attack."
		"- Can &4&lbreak fences&f&r and &4&ldoors&f&r."
		""
		"Weakness:"
		"- It is &c&lvulnerable while flying&f&r, so try &2&lflanking it mid-air&f&r."
		"- It cannot &6&lstop mid-flight&f&r. If you lure it near a &8&lcliff&f&r or &9&ldeep river&f&r while it is chasing you, it may accidentally &c&lfall&f&r."
		""
		"\"&6&lThey love killing&f&r and &4&leating animals&f&r, so keep them &2&lsafe&f&r.\""
	]
	quest.751CE709736FE6AB.quest_subtitle: "&lKill The Hunter (Demonic undead)"
	quest.751CE709736FE6AB.title: "&8&lKill The Hunter"
	quest.755427FAABBB8A56.quest_desc: [
		"&fTo sustain large-scale firearm combat and explosive warfare, ordinary gunpowder must be refined into a more stable and concentrated form. The resulting &aPacked Gunpowder &fserves as a critical explosive material used in the production of ammunition, grenades and various military explosives throughout &aAlliance of Valiant Arms. &fAs combat intensifies and weapon usage increases, maintaining a steady supply of this resource will become essential for continued military operations."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/images/gunpowder.png width:100 height:55 align:center}"
	]
	quest.755427FAABBB8A56.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft Packed Gunpowder"
	quest.755427FAABBB8A56.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eCompressed Explosive Compound"
	quest.75AF1215667FE365.quest_desc: [
		""
		"HP: &2&l10-12&f&r  "
		"Spawns: &6&lAnywhere in the Overworld&f&r  "
		"Melee Damage: &2&l10&f&r + &4&lexplosion&f&r  "
		""
		"Special Abilities:  "
		"- They will &6&lburrow underground&f&r and only appear once they are close to their &c&ltarget&f&r.  "
		"- They may sometimes emerge from the &7&lroof&f&r instead of the ground if there is one.  "
		"- They &4&lexplode on contact&f&r (but can be &2&lblocked&f&r).  "
		""
		"Upon dying, they start to &6&lbloat&f&r and then &4&lexplode&f&r; you can fling them away using any &2&ltool&f&r, but that blast &c&lcannot be blocked&f&r.  "
		""
		"Tip: They make &e&lsounds&f&r when they emerge or move underground.  "
		""
		"Notes: Goo can be washed off with &9&lwater&f&r, and any mob that is &2&lgooed&f&r will take extra &c&lfire damage&f&r."
	]
	quest.75AF1215667FE365.quest_subtitle: "&lKill The Bidy (True Zombie)"
	quest.75AF1215667FE365.title: "&8&lKill The Bidy"
	quest.761AF8D3829FB12F.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Wyvern Shovel"
	quest.761AF8D3829FB12F.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eDraconic Excavation"
	quest.7627BA1A46CE337E.quest_desc: ["&fWith stable energy generation and crystal transmission systems now established, the path toward true &aFusion Crafting &fcan finally begin. From this point onward, draconic technology advances far beyond simple machines and components, unlocking access to powerful fusion systems, advanced equipment and increasingly complex creations. Proper energy management and the use of connected &aEnergy Crystals &fwill become essential for sustaining the immense power required by future draconic engineering."]
	quest.7627BA1A46CE337E.quest_subtitle: "&7Harness energy beyond mortal limits"
	quest.7627BA1A46CE337E.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eThe Age of Fusion Begins"
	quest.7761635EF7DDD4CD.quest_desc: ["Craft armor to protect yourself from magical threats. "]
	quest.7761635EF7DDD4CD.quest_subtitle: "Use magical materials to craft armor."
	quest.7761635EF7DDD4CD.title: "Craft Magical Armor"
	quest.77C05A9D3FE10987.quest_desc: ["&fUsing the power of the &aIgnitium Upgrade &fand the rare materials gathered from &aIgnis, &fadventurers can forge the legendary &aIgnitium Armor, &fa powerful set infused with overwhelming fire resistance and unmatched durability. This armor stands among the strongest defensive equipment obtainable and will become incredibly valuable for surviving the catastrophic encounters awaiting near the end of your journey."]
	quest.77C05A9D3FE10987.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Ignitium Armor"
	quest.77C05A9D3FE10987.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eArmor Tempered by Cataclysm"
	quest.783B19283A6AC2B3.quest_desc: ["&fTo advance further into the secrets of &aDraconic Engineering, &fadventurers must challenge and defeat the legendary &aEnder Dragon. &fThis battle is essential for obtaining unique draconic materials such as the &aDragon Egg, Dragon Heart &fand valuable &aDraconium Dust, &fresources required for advanced fusion crafting and the creation of powerful technological artifacts. Without these rare materials, many of the strongest draconic systems and upgrades will remain forever out of reach."]
	quest.783B19283A6AC2B3.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat the Ender Dragon"
	quest.783B19283A6AC2B3.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eHeart of the Ancient Dragon"
	quest.7873AAFE06BB2DE0.quest_desc: ["This a magical crafting material harvested from Magebloom plants, used to create spellcasting robes and creating new crafting items."]
	quest.7873AAFE06BB2DE0.quest_subtitle: "This fiber creates powerful equipment."
	quest.7873AAFE06BB2DE0.title: "magic fiber"
	quest.7950B051625DAFC8.quest_desc: ["&fAt the core of the &aAncient Factory &fsleeps the catastrophic entity known as &aThe Harbinger, &fa monstrous mechanical horror bearing similarities to the legendary Wither itself. To awaken this creature, adventurers must offer a &aNether Star, &factivating the ancient machine once more. The Harbinger is an extremely dangerous opponent capable of unleashing devastating explosions and overwhelming attacks, but defeating it grants access to some of the most important rewards in this stage of progression. Among its valuable loot are the legendary &aMechanical Fusion Anvil &fand the destructive &aWither Assault Shoulder Weapon."]
	quest.7950B051625DAFC8.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat The Harbinger"
	quest.7950B051625DAFC8.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eThe Machine That Devours Worlds"
	quest.79A251120A9917CD.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Wyvern Sword"
	quest.79A251120A9917CD.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eBlade of the Wyvern"
	quest.7B18DEA473B16CCA.quest_desc: [
		"&f&oDiscover a Barakoa Village with patrolling masked warriors."
		"&f&oWear a Barakoa mask to approach their leader safely and trade."
	]
	quest.7B18DEA473B16CCA.quest_subtitle: "&7Masks, blowguns, and a sun throne"
	quest.7B18DEA473B16CCA.title: "&f&lRaid the Barakoa Village"
	quest.7CA737C76D0E1867.quest_desc: ["&fThe graveyard has fallen silent, a chilling omen of the horrors that lurk within. A &c&lDecrepit Skeleton&r&f, a creature of ancient evil, has taken root there, cursing the land with its malevolent presence. Its very bones whisper of forgotten suffering, and you must silence them forever."]
	quest.7CA737C76D0E1867.quest_subtitle: "&lA curse that echoes from ancient tombs"
	quest.7CA737C76D0E1867.title: "&8&lThe Whispering Bones"
	quest.7DEE0DB11E4B2555.quest_desc: ["This magic seed is used to grow magic flower, a plant that produces magic flower fiber, an important resource for crafting magic equipment and items."]
	quest.7DEE0DB11E4B2555.quest_subtitle: "You should grow this seed like any other plant."
	quest.7DEE0DB11E4B2555.title: "Get the seed Magebloom seed"
	quest.7E17072B4ABA2026.quest_desc: ["&fFor prolonged military operations and large-scale combat scenarios, the upgraded &aAmmo Kit I &fprovides a significantly larger ammunition reserve containing up to &a1000 rounds. &fThis advanced supply package greatly reduces the need for constant ammunition crafting, making it invaluable during extended expeditions, sieges and dangerous battlefield engagements."]
	quest.7E17072B4ABA2026.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Ammo Kit I"
	quest.7E17072B4ABA2026.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eLarge Scale Ammunition Reserves"
	quest.7E44D8FB0AAA854C.quest_desc: ["&fTo expand the possibilities of draconic transportation networks, adventurers can craft the powerful &aDislocator Pedestal. &fThis device can be placed almost anywhere and allows a bound &aDislocator &fto be inserted directly into the pedestal. Once installed, players can simply right-click the pedestal to teleport to the stored destination without consuming any of the Dislocator's limited uses. Through this system, entire teleportation networks and fast-travel infrastructures can be created across distant locations and dimensions."]
	quest.7E44D8FB0AAA854C.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Dislocator Pedestal"
	quest.7E44D8FB0AAA854C.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eAnchors of Instant Travel"
	quest.7E7F612F76FED684.quest_desc: ["Wixies can automate crafting tasks, saving you time and effort. "]
	quest.7E7F612F76FED684.quest_subtitle: "Use a Wixie to automate crafting."
	quest.7E7F612F76FED684.title: "Automate a Task"
	quest.7F0C0A792F62F67C.quest_desc: ["&fA new terror stalks the night. The &c&lDread Hound&r&f, a ghastly and skeletal creature, has been sighted roaming the desolate landscapes. With its glowing red eyes and bony frame, it hunts with a ferocious hunger. Its haunting howl strikes fear into the hearts of any who hear it. You must track down and slay this monstrous beast to restore peace to the land."]
	quest.7F0C0A792F62F67C.quest_subtitle: "&lA spectral terror haunting the desolate landscape"
	quest.7F0C0A792F62F67C.title: "&8&lA Dread Hound"
	quest.7FA10C025B1F8C24.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the Draconic Bow"
	quest.7FA10C025B1F8C24.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eBow of Endless Annihilation"
	quest.7FE6353456027898.quest_desc: ["&fAs your understanding of draconic energy continues to evolve, ordinary crafting methods become insufficient for handling increasingly powerful materials and artifacts. Through the use of &aFusion Crafting, &fadventurers can channel massive amounts of energy into advanced technological transformations, allowing the creation of legendary equipment, powerful cores and high-tier draconic machinery. From this point onward, mastering fusion systems, injector tiers and stable energy distribution will become essential for progressing deeper into &aDraconic Engineering."]
	quest.7FE6353456027898.quest_subtitle: "&7Unlock the path of advanced draconic crafting"
	quest.7FE6353456027898.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&eFusion Engineering"
